WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club

﻿1

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:14.081
"With God,
all things are possible."


00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:16.350
Matthew 19:26


00:00:17.284 --> 00:00:20.020
Over the years, I've shared
that verse more times


00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:21.956
than I could ever count.


00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:25.192
But now for the first time,
I know it's true.


00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:26.928
You see, six months ago,


00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:29.998
something impossible
did happen down there.


00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:32.767
One instant of time,
millions of people


00:00:32.867 --> 00:00:35.168
just disappeared
without a trace.


00:00:35.269 --> 00:00:37.839
Poof, gone,
just like that.


00:00:37.939 --> 00:00:40.207
Well, if that's not impossible,


00:00:40.307 --> 00:00:42.544
then I don't know what is.


00:00:42.644 --> 00:00:44.746
Its cleanup efforts continue
in the aftermath


00:00:44.846 --> 00:00:46.113
of the vanishings.


00:00:46.213 --> 00:00:49.216
Single most catastrophic event
in all of human history.


00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:52.654
And security forces work
to stem worldwide violence.


00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:55.489
There's still more questions
than answers.


00:00:55.590 --> 00:00:57.224
Today, people still say


00:00:57.324 --> 00:00:59.661
the vanishings came
without a warning


00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:01.563
or any kind of explanation.


00:01:01.663 --> 00:01:03.397
But that's just not true.


00:01:03.497 --> 00:01:06.400
There were plenty of warnings
and explanations.


00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:09.202
But there were also
plenty of closed minds.


00:01:09.303 --> 00:01:11.138
While the President insists


00:01:11.238 --> 00:01:13.007
that the greatest threat
to our country


00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.075
is those clinging
to the conspiracy theory


00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:16.978
that somehow God
had something to do


00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.078
with the vanishings.


00:01:18.646 --> 00:01:20.515
And we all know
that a closed mind


00:01:20.615 --> 00:01:23.051
is not an easy thing
to pry open.


00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:25.185
But even after watching
all those people


00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.254
just vanished into thin air,


00:01:27.354 --> 00:01:29.122
most people
still had no interest


00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:31.258
in the fact that all of it
was written down


00:01:31.358 --> 00:01:34.996
thousands of years ago
in that dusty old book


00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.330
on the shelf.


00:01:36.430 --> 00:01:39.867
It's been six months
since tens of millions of people


00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:41.368
suddenly disappeared.


00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:43.437
And as far as we're concerned,


00:01:43.538 --> 00:01:45.372
none of them
had been seen since.


00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.407
So, they hid
from the truth mostly,


00:01:47.508 --> 00:01:49.577
dreaming up any answer
they could think of,


00:01:49.677 --> 00:01:52.747
as long as it didn't involve
God, of course.


00:01:52.847 --> 00:01:55.049
Solar flares, secret weapons,


00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:57.217
Little Green Men.


00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:59.252
Nothing was too crazy
for a world


00:01:59.353 --> 00:02:01.421
determined not to see the truth.


00:02:01.522 --> 00:02:03.925
And, of course, one thing
you can always count on


00:02:04.025 --> 00:02:05.492
when disaster strikes.


00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.029
There are those
whose first thought


00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.130
is how to seize the opportunity.


00:02:10.999 --> 00:02:12.199
For Jonathan Stonagal,


00:02:12.299 --> 00:02:13.835
while he seemed to have
his plan in place


00:02:13.935 --> 00:02:17.270
before those empty clothes
that even hit the ground.


00:02:17.371 --> 00:02:20.307
Now you understand,
Mr. Stonagal,


00:02:20.407 --> 00:02:22.010
if it were up to me,


00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.311
I wouldn't be questioning
any of this.


00:02:26.547 --> 00:02:31.318
It is up to UN, all of it.


00:02:31.886 --> 00:02:33.387
The board can't interfere
with what I'm doing


00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:35.890
without unanimous consent.


00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:38.325
You're not here to tell me


00:02:38.425 --> 00:02:39.527
that you're turning
your back on me now.


00:02:39.627 --> 00:02:40.662
Are you, Ed?


00:02:41.996 --> 00:02:45.298
I've turned hundreds
into thousands,


00:02:45.399 --> 00:02:48.870
thousands into millions,
millions into billions.


00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:51.371
And still,
the bean counters think


00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:53.608
that they know what's best.


00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:56.844
We're losing millions
of dollars everyday now


00:02:56.944 --> 00:03:01.214
with all of your new projects
and investments.


00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:04.786
And even the biggest
social media platform in history


00:03:04.886 --> 00:03:08.455
buying up every media company
you can get your hands on.


00:03:08.556 --> 00:03:10.223
You don't need to be
the only source


00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.392
of news and information.


00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:16.698
And now, $400 million
to build a temple


00:03:16.798 --> 00:03:18.099
in the Middle East?


00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.434
It's a nice temple.


00:03:20.535 --> 00:03:23.203
<i>Sir, your two o'clock is here.</i>


00:03:24.105 --> 00:03:25.740
I suggest you go
and give serious thought


00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:29.811
as to what side of the table
you wanna be sitting on.


00:03:29.911 --> 00:03:31.846
Something big is coming.


00:03:32.914 --> 00:03:35.415
Trust me.


00:03:35.516 --> 00:03:38.251
You wanna make sure
you're on the right team.


00:03:40.621 --> 00:03:42.857
<i>Does people grapple</i>
<i>with a new reality</i>


00:03:42.957 --> 00:03:44.859
<i>Trying to accept the fact</i>
<i>that they may never see</i>


00:03:44.959 --> 00:03:46.961
<i>those missing loved ones again.</i>


00:03:47.061 --> 00:03:48.996
<i>Faith in our leaders is gone.</i>


00:03:49.097 --> 00:03:52.633
<i>And frustration and anger</i>
<i>is in an all-time high.</i>


00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:55.402
<i>Not only have violent crimes</i>
<i>risen dramatically,</i>


00:03:55.503 --> 00:03:57.705
<i>but suicides are soaring</i>
<i>out of control.</i>


00:03:57.805 --> 00:04:00.508
<i>But according</i>
<i>to mental health experts,</i>


00:04:00.608 --> 00:04:02.777
<i>there is an explanation</i>
<i>to what's going on.</i>


00:04:02.877 --> 00:04:04.444
<i>We're going to get into that</i>
<i>with one of them</i>


00:04:04.545 --> 00:04:05.780
<i>right after the break.</i>


00:04:06.781 --> 00:04:08.683
<i>Tonight on GWN...</i>


00:04:14.122 --> 00:04:15.189
I have to admit,


00:04:15.288 --> 00:04:18.526
I was never a big fan
of Rayford Steele.


00:04:18.626 --> 00:04:20.427
His wife, Irene,
had tried for years


00:04:20.528 --> 00:04:22.830
to get him to join us
at New Hope.


00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:26.266
But I guess church
just wasn't his thing.


00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.435
When she did manage
to drag him there,


00:04:28.536 --> 00:04:30.605
he'd either read
the sports news on his phone


00:04:30.705 --> 00:04:33.040
or grab a quick nap
thinking everyone would believe


00:04:33.141 --> 00:04:34.942
he's praying.


00:04:39.247 --> 00:04:41.314
Irene had warned him
about the Rapture


00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:42.884
over and over again.


00:04:42.984 --> 00:04:45.186
Or at least
that's how it seemed to him.


00:04:45.285 --> 00:04:48.055
<i>- I just can't control.</i>
<i>- This is Pampam 257.</i>


00:04:48.156 --> 00:04:51.993
<i>We have an emergency.</i>
<i>I repeat, we have an emergency.</i>


00:04:52.527 --> 00:04:55.730
JFK Control, listen to me.
We've lost passengers.


00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:58.232
People have literally
disappeared from the plane


00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.934
at 30,000 feet.


00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:05.840
So, when half the passengers
on his transatlantic flight


00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:07.307
vanished that night,


00:05:07.407 --> 00:05:10.278
he knew right away
what had happened.


00:05:10.377 --> 00:05:13.480
He may not have fully understood
what it meant,


00:05:13.581 --> 00:05:15.817
but Irene had told him
what would happen.


00:05:15.917 --> 00:05:17.218
And it did.


00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:42.944
And so, at least Ray knew
one thing for sure.


00:05:43.044 --> 00:05:46.614
He desperately wanted
to believe that Irene was right.


00:05:46.714 --> 00:05:49.050
I miss you and Rayme so much.


00:05:51.786 --> 00:05:54.421
It's been hard.


00:05:54.522 --> 00:05:59.093
I just keep thinking
about the things I said and did.


00:06:02.096 --> 00:06:04.765
Well, you know much I love you.


00:06:06.067 --> 00:06:08.669
I just wish I could see you
one more time.


00:06:10.204 --> 00:06:12.405
But I know I can't.


00:06:14.108 --> 00:06:16.811
Yeah, I know I can't.


00:06:20.815 --> 00:06:22.516
The world's obsession
with the vanishings


00:06:22.617 --> 00:06:23.918
is still in full force.


00:06:24.018 --> 00:06:27.688
And since we have no answers
from our supposed leaders,


00:06:27.788 --> 00:06:29.557
that's not really a surprise.


00:06:29.657 --> 00:06:31.491
And while the immediate panic
and acute terror


00:06:31.592 --> 00:06:34.362
may have passed,
I don't think anyone can say


00:06:34.461 --> 00:06:36.330
that the world
is not a completely


00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:38.032
different place now.


00:06:38.132 --> 00:06:39.734
In the past six months,


00:06:39.834 --> 00:06:42.036
we've seen a dramatic,
even shocking increase


00:06:42.136 --> 00:06:45.640
in virtually every metric
of human depravity.


00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:47.775
Compared to the same time
last year?


00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:51.245
Murders are up
by more than 300%,


00:06:51.345 --> 00:06:54.782
and suicides
are up nearly 1,000%.


00:06:54.882 --> 00:06:57.118
The violent crime, assault,
rape, robbery,


00:06:57.218 --> 00:07:01.322
vandalism, looting, rioting,
they're all shattering records.


00:07:01.421 --> 00:07:03.357
And mental health experts
are telling us


00:07:03.456 --> 00:07:05.293
that the worst is yet to come.


00:07:05.393 --> 00:07:07.427
I have with me tonight,
Dr. Ruby Kincaid,


00:07:07.528 --> 00:07:09.730
who is leading
the multinational investigation


00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:13.601
into what many are now calling,
"a pandemic of evil."


00:07:13.701 --> 00:07:15.903
Doctor, thank you so much
for being here with us tonight.


00:07:16.003 --> 00:07:18.039
So, I guess we should just get
right to the heart


00:07:18.139 --> 00:07:19.073
of the matter.


00:07:19.173 --> 00:07:20.641
What's going on?


00:07:20.741 --> 00:07:22.510
In the case of the vanishings,


00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:25.413
there's simply
no historical knowledge


00:07:25.513 --> 00:07:26.614
to draw on.


00:07:26.714 --> 00:07:29.482
So, people are triggered
into a prolonged


00:07:29.583 --> 00:07:31.519
fight or flight reaction.


00:07:31.619 --> 00:07:37.490
There is anger, fear,
mistrust, retaliation.


00:07:37.591 --> 00:07:41.896
Those are powerful emotions,
and they need an outlet.


00:07:43.397 --> 00:07:46.767
So, do you think world leaders
and our own government as well


00:07:46.867 --> 00:07:50.004
should be doing a better job
at helping us understand


00:07:50.104 --> 00:07:51.572
exactly what's happening?


00:07:51.672 --> 00:07:54.542
I mean, I know we have no idea
where those people went,


00:07:54.642 --> 00:07:57.345
but telling everyone
to stay at home,


00:07:57.445 --> 00:07:58.646
stop asking so many questions.


00:07:58.746 --> 00:08:01.415
I mean,
that can't likely be helping.


00:08:01.515 --> 00:08:03.751
I think the root cause


00:08:03.851 --> 00:08:06.620
is not the lack
of clear information,


00:08:06.721 --> 00:08:09.557
but the abundance
of misinformation.


00:08:09.657 --> 00:08:12.393
Our leaders need to do more
to stop people


00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:15.296
from coming up
with conspiracy theories.


00:08:15.396 --> 00:08:17.064
So, ignorance is bliss?


00:08:17.164 --> 00:08:20.634
Protecting people
from dangerous ideas


00:08:20.735 --> 00:08:22.603
isn't making them ignorant.


00:08:22.703 --> 00:08:26.007
We need to make it our priority
to keep people safe.


00:08:26.107 --> 00:08:29.343
Keep them safe from
what exactly?


00:08:29.443 --> 00:08:31.278
Another wave of vanishings.


00:08:31.879 --> 00:08:34.415
What?


00:08:34.515 --> 00:08:38.019
Hold on.
A second wave of vanishings?


00:08:38.119 --> 00:08:41.622
Well, we have been feeding
all of the data


00:08:41.722 --> 00:08:44.158
we've managed to gather
about the vanishings


00:08:44.258 --> 00:08:45.726
into a database.


00:08:45.826 --> 00:08:47.995
We were then able
to use sophisticated


00:08:48.095 --> 00:08:51.932
computer algorithms
to create predictive models.


00:08:52.033 --> 00:08:54.435
And those models suggest
that a second wave


00:08:54.535 --> 00:08:58.205
is not only possible,
it's almost certain.


00:08:58.305 --> 00:09:00.875
So, computers figured this out.


00:09:00.975 --> 00:09:02.576
That's right.


00:09:02.676 --> 00:09:05.579
Do you yourself, personally,


00:09:05.679 --> 00:09:07.715
believe more people
are gonna disappear?


00:09:07.815 --> 00:09:09.884
Or do you think
that people are just better off


00:09:09.984 --> 00:09:13.454
scared right now, you know,
to keep them more compliant?


00:09:13.554 --> 00:09:15.189
I mean, we have a problem,


00:09:15.289 --> 00:09:19.160
where people are so terrified
and confused


00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.263
that they're becoming violent
and self-destructive.


00:09:22.363 --> 00:09:25.833
And you think coming on here
and scaring them even more


00:09:25.933 --> 00:09:27.635
is gonna somehow
make things better?


00:09:27.735 --> 00:09:29.703
Are you saying that you know
for a fact


00:09:29.804 --> 00:09:31.405
that it's not going
to happen again?


00:09:31.506 --> 00:09:34.041
Not at all. Not at all.


00:09:34.141 --> 00:09:35.743
I have no idea.


00:09:35.843 --> 00:09:37.578
<i>And I'm starting</i>
<i>to suspect that...</i>


00:09:37.678 --> 00:09:39.613
But at least
I'm not sitting here


00:09:39.713 --> 00:09:40.614
pretending like I do.


00:09:40.714 --> 00:09:43.617
I am talking about science here.


00:09:43.717 --> 00:09:45.853
And some of the world's
top scientists


00:09:45.953 --> 00:09:47.855
have studied the data
very carefully.


00:09:47.955 --> 00:09:49.290
-And it suggests--
-Where did it come from?


00:09:49.390 --> 00:09:51.659
-I'm sorry?
-The data?


00:09:51.759 --> 00:09:52.893
Where did it come from?


00:09:52.993 --> 00:09:54.795
All of the data
has been verified


00:09:54.895 --> 00:09:56.764
by the United Nations.


00:09:56.864 --> 00:09:58.232
It's all publicly available


00:09:58.332 --> 00:10:00.734
in the UN's Vanishing
Accountability Project.


00:10:00.835 --> 00:10:04.905
I'm asking you, where did they
get their information from?


00:10:05.005 --> 00:10:06.607
I just told you
all of the data has--


00:10:06.707 --> 00:10:08.476
- Cut it now.
- Buck, wrap it up.


00:10:08.577 --> 00:10:10.545
I'm sorry, but I guess
that is all the time


00:10:10.644 --> 00:10:11.513
we have for tonight.


00:10:11.612 --> 00:10:13.114
Thank you for coming on.


00:10:13.914 --> 00:10:16.518
But I do want to encourage
our viewers,


00:10:16.617 --> 00:10:18.385
keep demanding facts.


00:10:18.486 --> 00:10:21.689
Don't just blindly accept
whatever the so-called experts


00:10:21.789 --> 00:10:23.090
are telling us.


00:10:23.190 --> 00:10:24.792
And I wouldn't be too quick
to sign up


00:10:24.892 --> 00:10:27.161
for a vanishing's vaccine
either.


00:10:27.261 --> 00:10:30.764
I'm Cameron Williams.
Up next is Victoria Jordan.


00:10:30.865 --> 00:10:31.732
We'll see you in a minute.


00:10:31.832 --> 00:10:33.234
And we are out.


00:10:33.334 --> 00:10:35.102
Who killed that?


00:10:35.769 --> 00:10:37.572
We were not out of time.


00:10:47.348 --> 00:10:49.884
Wow, Captain Steele.


00:10:49.984 --> 00:10:52.887
It's good to see you.


00:10:53.921 --> 00:10:55.189
Ooh.


00:10:55.289 --> 00:11:00.027
Captain, you're aware
that we do not encourage


00:11:00.127 --> 00:11:02.696
unkempt hair for our pilots.
Are you not?


00:11:02.796 --> 00:11:04.131
Unkempt? I just showered
last week.


00:11:04.231 --> 00:11:06.568
And these pants,
those aren't standard issue,


00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:07.502
are they?


00:11:07.602 --> 00:11:08.570
And the next time we meet,


00:11:08.669 --> 00:11:09.604
I want to see a shine
on those feet.


00:11:09.703 --> 00:11:11.705
I'll see what I can do.


00:11:11.805 --> 00:11:14.175
You look great, Dad.


00:11:14.275 --> 00:11:17.512
Hey, and look, look,
at least it still fit.


00:11:17.612 --> 00:11:20.080
Yeah.


00:11:21.048 --> 00:11:23.984
So, are you thinking of getting
into the pilot seat?


00:11:24.084 --> 00:11:25.554
Yeah. Well, I was thinking
maybe I could do


00:11:25.654 --> 00:11:26.987
a couple of runs for FedEx,
you know?


00:11:27.087 --> 00:11:29.190
So, I'm going to be gone
for days on end.


00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.092
You know, I was hated
being away so much,


00:11:32.193 --> 00:11:35.696
you know, from you
and Rayme and mom so...


00:11:35.796 --> 00:11:39.833
-Plus, no passengers.
-Yeah.


00:11:40.868 --> 00:11:42.803
Plus, no passengers.


00:11:44.705 --> 00:11:47.208
Okay, Captain.


00:11:49.210 --> 00:11:50.311
I'm hungry.
Did you make me breakfast?


00:11:50.411 --> 00:11:51.845
- Did you make me breakfast?
- Well, no.


00:11:51.946 --> 00:11:53.582
What do you mean? You're the one
who's up before me.


00:11:53.682 --> 00:11:54.715
All right.


00:11:55.049 --> 00:11:57.051
- Where's Ivy?
- I'm right here.


00:11:57.151 --> 00:11:58.385
I can't believe you changed
the B-roll


00:11:58.485 --> 00:11:59.521
without asking me first.


00:11:59.621 --> 00:12:01.155
I didn't touch it
after you proved it.


00:12:01.255 --> 00:12:02.591
I thought
you're in the control room.


00:12:02.691 --> 00:12:05.560
I was. No one came in.


00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.228
-Connor.
-Connor.


00:12:07.895 --> 00:12:09.698
Don't get Connor fired.
He's just a kid.


00:12:09.797 --> 00:12:10.831
You think I'm mad at Connor?


00:12:10.931 --> 00:12:12.534
What is he going to do?
Say no to Plank?


00:12:12.634 --> 00:12:13.734
-I would have.
-Yeah.


00:12:13.834 --> 00:12:15.069
Well, I'm sure
that's why he didn't ask you.


00:12:15.169 --> 00:12:16.804
Well, maybe it's because
there's only one guy here


00:12:16.904 --> 00:12:18.640
that knows how to swap
the footage in a live broadcast


00:12:18.739 --> 00:12:20.241
without setting
for the control room.


00:12:20.874 --> 00:12:22.276
Did you really think
I would change your B-roll


00:12:22.376 --> 00:12:24.478
in a live show
without your approval?


00:12:24.579 --> 00:12:25.913
Of course not.


00:12:26.013 --> 00:12:28.816
Buck's relentless reporting
brought GWN


00:12:28.916 --> 00:12:31.686
its highest ratings ever.


00:12:31.819 --> 00:12:34.154
But it seemed the closer
he got to the truth,


00:12:34.255 --> 00:12:37.091
the more his own network
pushed back.


00:12:37.525 --> 00:12:38.959
Mr. Williams, I am so sorry.


00:12:39.059 --> 00:12:40.794
Ivy had no idea that the B-roll
was gonna be charged.


00:12:40.894 --> 00:12:42.129
Connor, it's fine.


00:12:42.229 --> 00:12:43.531
I'm sure you weren't really
in a position


00:12:43.632 --> 00:12:45.366
to argue with Mr. Plank, right?


00:12:46.100 --> 00:12:48.168
Thank you
for understanding, sir.


00:12:48.703 --> 00:12:50.104
-Plank.
-Be gentle.


00:12:50.204 --> 00:12:51.372
You know me better than that.


00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.875
Okay, Steve, I know
you have shareholders


00:12:54.975 --> 00:12:57.311
to appease,
but I have a contract.


00:12:57.411 --> 00:12:59.514
-And a pretty good one at that.
-And.


00:12:59.614 --> 00:13:02.249
And it means I don't have
to give primetime exposure


00:13:02.349 --> 00:13:05.252
to crackpot
conspiracy theorists like her.


00:13:05.352 --> 00:13:06.920
You're a reporter, Buck.


00:13:07.021 --> 00:13:09.724
Sometimes that means going
outside of your comfort zone


00:13:09.823 --> 00:13:10.791
and interviewing people


00:13:10.891 --> 00:13:14.261
that you don't always
agree with.


00:13:14.361 --> 00:13:18.432
I'm happy to talk to anybody
with a news or the story.


00:13:18.533 --> 00:13:22.269
It was fearmongering, Plank.
Plain and simple.


00:13:22.369 --> 00:13:23.738
Computers.


00:13:23.837 --> 00:13:26.641
Computers say more people
are gonna vanish.


00:13:26.741 --> 00:13:29.009
Well, maybe she should spend
her time trying to find people


00:13:29.109 --> 00:13:31.478
who already disappeared.


00:13:31.579 --> 00:13:32.880
Are you done?


00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:35.115
What was up
with that B-roll horror show?


00:13:35.215 --> 00:13:38.185
I thought you'd be pleased.


00:13:38.285 --> 00:13:41.388
I had our editors
and the new kid


00:13:41.488 --> 00:13:45.760
dig up something
a little more sensational.


00:13:45.859 --> 00:13:47.629
Sensational?


00:13:47.729 --> 00:13:49.664
Plank, you showed a video


00:13:49.764 --> 00:13:51.131
of terrified
and desperate people


00:13:51.231 --> 00:13:53.000
jumping off of buildings.


00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.503
It's not sensational.
It's just sick.


00:13:55.603 --> 00:13:56.805
And using Connor?


00:13:56.904 --> 00:13:58.272
I mean, the kid has only been
here a few months.


00:13:58.372 --> 00:14:00.374
You're already teaching him
the art of fake news?


00:14:00.474 --> 00:14:02.142
Come on, wake up, Buck!


00:14:02.242 --> 00:14:04.345
Our military and our police
were decimated


00:14:04.445 --> 00:14:06.013
with the vanishings.


00:14:06.113 --> 00:14:07.881
Scared people stay
in their homes.


00:14:07.981 --> 00:14:10.250
They lock themselves inside.


00:14:10.351 --> 00:14:12.286
And that's what we need
right now.


00:14:12.386 --> 00:14:14.054
Don't you think
that locking people


00:14:14.154 --> 00:14:16.857
in their homes is gonna add
to the problem?


00:14:16.957 --> 00:14:18.225
We grieve by sharing.


00:14:18.325 --> 00:14:20.160
We have a lot of people
that need to deal with the fact


00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:22.029
that they lost everything
that matters.


00:14:22.129 --> 00:14:24.198
Their wives--


00:14:25.834 --> 00:14:29.036
-Yes, Erica.
-Did you see the UN story?


00:14:29.136 --> 00:14:30.739
They're pushing
for the Romanian president


00:14:30.839 --> 00:14:32.607
to be the new Secretary General.


00:14:32.707 --> 00:14:35.510
-Carpathia?
-So?


00:14:36.143 --> 00:14:37.344
So, it's just strange


00:14:37.444 --> 00:14:39.246
he didn't even ask
to be appointed.


00:14:39.346 --> 00:14:42.182
Did they overtake the UN
by force?


00:14:42.282 --> 00:14:44.118
No, he hasn't even made
a statement.


00:14:44.218 --> 00:14:45.820
Then it's not news.


00:14:45.953 --> 00:14:49.624
So, please,
go and find me some news.


00:14:54.529 --> 00:14:58.098
Buck, the last thing
we need right now


00:14:58.198 --> 00:15:00.367
are the streets overrun


00:15:00.467 --> 00:15:04.138
with unstable and potentially
violent people.


00:15:04.238 --> 00:15:06.841
So, until the authorities
can get their arms,


00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:10.310
their fat arms
around this thing


00:15:10.411 --> 00:15:14.549
it is our duty to do
what we can.


00:15:14.649 --> 00:15:17.786
If you think that somehow
it's your civic duty


00:15:17.886 --> 00:15:21.556
to terrify people,
I can't stop you.


00:15:21.656 --> 00:15:25.092
But it's the last time
you're gonna do it on my show.


00:15:25.192 --> 00:15:28.563
Well, then maybe
it's time to think


00:15:28.663 --> 00:15:31.398
about cancelling your show.


00:15:34.736 --> 00:15:37.672
Yeah, I think we both know
that's not gonna happen.


00:15:40.974 --> 00:15:42.710
Try me.


00:16:04.632 --> 00:16:08.603
It seems that Chloe Steele
spent most of her time haunted,


00:16:08.703 --> 00:16:11.171
tortured by the memory
of her little brother,


00:16:11.271 --> 00:16:14.709
vanishing right from her arms
as she hugged him.


00:16:15.409 --> 00:16:17.679
How could she have done things
differently?


00:16:17.779 --> 00:16:22.416
How could she have saved him
from whatever it was?


00:16:23.651 --> 00:16:27.454
She was terrified
that he was lost forever.


00:16:27.555 --> 00:16:31.726
And that somehow,
it was her fault.


00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.061
<i>It's always been my position</i>


00:16:34.161 --> 00:16:36.531
<i>that we should take advantage</i>
<i>of every crisis</i>


00:16:36.631 --> 00:16:38.432
<i>to make the world</i>
<i>a better place.</i>


00:16:38.533 --> 00:16:41.068
<i>With each disaster,</i>
<i>storm, or war,</i>


00:16:41.168 --> 00:16:45.807
<i>comes the opportunity</i>
<i>for all of us to do better.</i>


00:16:45.907 --> 00:16:47.307
<i>As our climate gets hotter,</i>


00:16:47.407 --> 00:16:49.878
<i>as we become more</i>
<i>interconnected,</i>


00:16:49.978 --> 00:16:52.012
<i>as pandemics race</i>
<i>across the globe,</i>


00:16:52.112 --> 00:16:54.047
<i>something is coming.</i>


00:16:54.147 --> 00:16:58.318
<i>Some crisis will strike</i>
<i>all of us.</i>


00:16:58.418 --> 00:17:01.556
<i>And we should welcome</i>
<i>whatever it is with open arms.</i>


00:17:01.656 --> 00:17:03.758
<i>Because only then</i>
<i>will the world finally</i>


00:17:03.858 --> 00:17:08.195
<i>come together and create</i>
<i>a truly global union.</i>


00:17:08.295 --> 00:17:14.101
<i>A single world government</i>
<i>founded on peace and unity.</i>


00:17:26.113 --> 00:17:27.047
<i>Buck, what's going on?</i>


00:17:27.147 --> 00:17:28.482
Hey, remember that guy, Davos,


00:17:28.583 --> 00:17:32.452
last year talking about
opportunity and catastrophe?


00:17:32.554 --> 00:17:34.388
<i>Well, that was almost</i>
<i>all of them.</i>


00:17:34.488 --> 00:17:36.791
True. Well, this guy's name
is Cothran.


00:17:36.891 --> 00:17:39.359
He owns Dominator Analytics.
And I think he may be--


00:17:39.459 --> 00:17:41.029
<i>Whoa, whoa, whoa,</i>
<i>let's not do this</i>


00:17:41.128 --> 00:17:42.129
<i>over the phone.</i>


00:17:42.229 --> 00:17:44.464
<i>Let's just say</i>
<i>it's a rabbit hole.</i>


00:17:44.566 --> 00:17:47.067
I do love a good rabbit.
I'm on my way.


00:18:35.215 --> 00:18:39.887
Please. Pleas no.
Please let me go.


00:18:39.988 --> 00:18:42.155
Please let me in. Let me...


00:18:42.255 --> 00:18:44.157
No. Let me in!


00:18:44.257 --> 00:18:45.492
Chloe, wake up.


00:18:45.593 --> 00:18:46.861
Hey, hey, wake up.


00:18:50.464 --> 00:18:53.333
Are you... are you okay?


00:18:55.135 --> 00:18:57.270
Yeah, I'm fine.


00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:01.609
That must have been
quite a dream.


00:19:05.113 --> 00:19:07.147
It was just really real.


00:19:07.247 --> 00:19:08.448
You know, like,
it was like a nightmare,


00:19:08.549 --> 00:19:14.388
but it's like I was losing him
all over again.


00:19:15.255 --> 00:19:18.191
We all have different ways
of dealing with things


00:19:18.291 --> 00:19:20.528
that we don't understand.


00:19:23.865 --> 00:19:27.267
But I think it's time
to focus on the future.


00:19:27.367 --> 00:19:32.073
As hard as it is,
we have to stop looking back.


00:19:32.172 --> 00:19:35.109
Well, then where am I
supposed to look?


00:19:35.208 --> 00:19:36.511
Because back is where
we lost them.


00:19:36.611 --> 00:19:39.080
I know. I know.


00:19:39.179 --> 00:19:41.214
You're not the only one
who needs to find


00:19:41.314 --> 00:19:43.685
a new approach.


00:19:43.785 --> 00:19:46.654
We have both been hiding
for too long.


00:19:49.157 --> 00:19:53.094
Mom and Rayme,
they're counting on us


00:19:53.193 --> 00:19:54.762
to do the right thing.


00:19:54.862 --> 00:19:56.631
What do you mean
they were counting on us?


00:19:56.731 --> 00:20:01.869
No. No.
I mean, they are counting on us.


00:20:03.171 --> 00:20:05.606
And what makes you so sure?


00:20:07.842 --> 00:20:10.410
Because mom told us.


00:20:10.878 --> 00:20:13.081
Okay.


00:20:13.181 --> 00:20:15.683
What, because mom said so?


00:20:15.783 --> 00:20:18.986
That didn't even work
when I was 12.


00:20:19.087 --> 00:20:23.390
Besides, mom's Rapture theories
are already been proven wrong.


00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:28.029
So, do you think Mom was stupid
or just gullible?


00:20:28.129 --> 00:20:30.497
What? I never said that.


00:20:30.598 --> 00:20:33.768
Then don't you think
that we owe her


00:20:33.868 --> 00:20:37.839
the courtesy of considering
the fact that she told us


00:20:37.939 --> 00:20:40.407
it was going to happen?


00:20:40.508 --> 00:20:43.778
Sure, it was easy to dismiss it
before it happened.


00:20:43.878 --> 00:20:48.315
But doesn't it seem strange
that it's still so easy


00:20:48.415 --> 00:20:50.918
to dismiss it now?


00:20:51.753 --> 00:20:55.590
Even though we saw it
with our own eyes?


00:21:21.883 --> 00:21:23.751
Enter.


00:21:27.889 --> 00:21:30.191
Unless you're gonna at least
try to stop acting


00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:31.626
like a crazy
conspiracy theorist.


00:21:31.726 --> 00:21:34.294
Well, who are you calling
a conspiracy theorist?


00:21:34.394 --> 00:21:36.097
So you're just admitting
to being crazy?


00:21:36.197 --> 00:21:38.199
Yes. I'm quite comfortable
with that.


00:21:38.298 --> 00:21:40.635
Shut the door.


00:21:42.904 --> 00:21:47.407
Here. So Cothran,
and his Dominator Analytics


00:21:47.508 --> 00:21:49.342
provides virtually
all the raw data,


00:21:49.442 --> 00:21:51.078
the UN compiled all of it;


00:21:51.179 --> 00:21:53.080
surveys, research studies,
polls.


00:21:53.181 --> 00:21:54.347
These guys do it all.


00:21:54.447 --> 00:21:55.750
And they've got
the market cornered.


00:21:55.850 --> 00:21:57.350
So, you're saying
they can just stand up


00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:58.886
and tell the world anything
they want?


00:21:58.986 --> 00:22:01.255
And they'd be able
to back it up with fake stats?


00:22:01.354 --> 00:22:03.958
-Yep.
-What about the vanishings?


00:22:04.058 --> 00:22:05.993
All those reports
about the year's total mass


00:22:06.093 --> 00:22:07.460
not changing that day,


00:22:07.562 --> 00:22:10.131
statistics about how many people
disappeared, who they were,


00:22:10.231 --> 00:22:12.166
how they might have been
different from the rest of us.


00:22:12.266 --> 00:22:13.500
-Those?
-Yep.


00:22:13.601 --> 00:22:15.236
All of it came
through Dominator.


00:22:15.335 --> 00:22:16.737
Wow.


00:22:16.838 --> 00:22:19.640
Well, at least we know
what Cothran's agenda is.


00:22:19.740 --> 00:22:21.474
He's at crisis to get us
to accept changes


00:22:21.576 --> 00:22:22.910
that we wouldn't have otherwise.


00:22:23.010 --> 00:22:24.779
When you have complete control
over the narrative


00:22:24.879 --> 00:22:26.814
like that guy does,
I mean, you can turn anything


00:22:26.914 --> 00:22:29.250
-into a crisis.
-That's all true.


00:22:29.349 --> 00:22:30.885
But Cothran is not the guy
calling the shots.


00:22:30.985 --> 00:22:34.989
-He's just another suit.
-So, who's calling the shots?


00:22:41.461 --> 00:22:45.432
These are interconnected
corporations.


00:22:45.533 --> 00:22:49.369
Fifteen television networks,
120 individual stations,


00:22:49.469 --> 00:22:52.707
almost 300 newspapers.
Remember newspapers?


00:22:52.807 --> 00:22:56.177
Let's see,
two Hollywood Film Studios,


00:22:56.277 --> 00:22:58.813
14 of the top 20 magazines.


00:22:58.913 --> 00:22:59.714
Believe it or not,


00:22:59.814 --> 00:23:01.315
the two biggest
pharmaceutical companies


00:23:01.414 --> 00:23:02.449
in the world.


00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:04.384
That's why we got rich of COVID.


00:23:04.484 --> 00:23:07.487
Look, here's one
you might find interesting.


00:23:07.588 --> 00:23:10.157
-He's your boss.
-GWN? No, that's not right.


00:23:10.258 --> 00:23:11.826
GWN is owned
by the Dornan family.


00:23:11.926 --> 00:23:15.029
And have you ever met
the Dornans?


00:23:15.129 --> 00:23:15.997
No.


00:23:16.097 --> 00:23:17.298
That's because
there is no Dornan family,


00:23:17.397 --> 00:23:18.599
never was.


00:23:18.699 --> 00:23:21.035
Jack Dornan never married.
He didn't have a family.


00:23:21.135 --> 00:23:22.770
He's been dead for 30 years.


00:23:22.870 --> 00:23:26.340
All of these companies
are run directly or indirectly


00:23:26.439 --> 00:23:29.810
by one man.
Jonathan Stonagal.


00:23:29.911 --> 00:23:33.748
-What? The Eden guy?
-One in the same.


00:23:33.848 --> 00:23:35.049
He's been pushing
something called


00:23:35.149 --> 00:23:36.550
the Great Reset for years,


00:23:36.651 --> 00:23:40.888
a true New World Order
globalist.


00:23:40.988 --> 00:23:43.157
I've been having a hard time
getting his message out.


00:23:43.257 --> 00:23:44.358
I mean what?


00:23:44.457 --> 00:23:45.726
Even though it already
has five billion users.


00:23:45.826 --> 00:23:48.362
-No, it's 6.5 now.
-Sheesh.


00:23:48.461 --> 00:23:50.564
What's amazing is that
he tripled his wealth


00:23:50.665 --> 00:23:52.266
during the COVID pandemic.


00:23:52.366 --> 00:23:53.433
And he tripled it again


00:23:53.534 --> 00:23:56.103
in the aftermath
of the vanishings.


00:23:56.203 --> 00:23:57.104
Let's go.


00:24:03.844 --> 00:24:06.614
-So? Where were you?
-Sorry?


00:24:06.714 --> 00:24:08.649
Where were you
when it happened?


00:24:08.749 --> 00:24:12.186
I was in a plane halfway
across the Atlantic.


00:24:12.286 --> 00:24:15.323
- I was right.
- About what?


00:24:15.423 --> 00:24:17.358
That you would have a cooler
story than I do.


00:24:20.728 --> 00:24:22.430
Best and worst day of my life.


00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:24.632
Way out of your league.


00:24:24.732 --> 00:24:26.267
Never let a crisis go to waste.


00:24:26.367 --> 00:24:27.068
-Right?
-Yeah.


00:24:27.168 --> 00:24:28.069
- Hi.
- Hey.


00:24:28.169 --> 00:24:31.238
So tell me, that her
boyfriend disappeared?


00:24:31.339 --> 00:24:33.341
What? How depraved
do you think I am?


00:24:33.441 --> 00:24:35.276
No, he didn't disappear.


00:24:35.376 --> 00:24:36.577
He was hit by a driverless bus.


00:24:38.478 --> 00:24:39.981
Hang on a second.


00:24:44.518 --> 00:24:45.353
Come here.


00:24:45.453 --> 00:24:47.521
Hold this and keep an eye out.


00:24:48.189 --> 00:24:50.358
It's heavy. Made of lead?


00:24:50.458 --> 00:24:53.694
Not made of. No.
But coated with.


00:24:53.794 --> 00:24:55.396
The Fed's devices
that can download


00:24:55.495 --> 00:24:57.665
your entire hard drive
from ten feet away.


00:24:58.366 --> 00:25:01.369
-Ever heard of a safe?
-Yeah.


00:25:01.469 --> 00:25:02.970
It's in the office
filing cabinet


00:25:03.070 --> 00:25:05.072
bolted to the floor.


00:25:05.172 --> 00:25:06.640
Let's go.


00:25:08.909 --> 00:25:10.211
You know, one day,
I'm gonna stumble


00:25:10.311 --> 00:25:12.346
into the wrong minefield
and the Feds are gonna clean up


00:25:12.446 --> 00:25:14.682
my office, including the safe.


00:25:14.782 --> 00:25:15.950
What are they gonna find?


00:25:16.050 --> 00:25:18.219
A hard drive
full of encrypted files.


00:25:18.319 --> 00:25:19.553
And if they keep out
long enough,


00:25:19.653 --> 00:25:21.455
they'll crack the encryption
and get the grand prize.


00:25:21.555 --> 00:25:22.923
Which is what?


00:25:23.024 --> 00:25:24.658
Thirty seasons of the Simpsons.


00:25:24.759 --> 00:25:26.794
That's gonna tick them off.


00:25:26.894 --> 00:25:28.562
Or maybe not. It's Blu-ray.


00:25:28.662 --> 00:25:29.597
Nice.


00:25:48.949 --> 00:25:53.287
Chloe couldn't help
but wonder if her dad was right.


00:25:53.387 --> 00:25:54.922
What if mom and Rayme were lost


00:25:55.022 --> 00:25:57.691
because of something
in that book?


00:25:57.792 --> 00:26:00.461
All she could do was wish
her mom had never opened


00:26:00.561 --> 00:26:03.130
that stupid Bible
in the first place.


00:26:25.853 --> 00:26:29.056
Buck and Chloe met on the day
of the Rapture.


00:26:29.156 --> 00:26:32.426
Buck had been a passenger
on that flight piloted by Ray.


00:26:32.527 --> 00:26:34.128
Many romantics would say
it was fate


00:26:34.228 --> 00:26:35.863
that brought Buck and Chloe
together.


00:26:35.963 --> 00:26:37.598
- Autograph.
- . Hey.


00:26:37.698 --> 00:26:39.733
But I now know that there was
a far greater force at work.


00:26:39.834 --> 00:26:41.869
They needed to be together.


00:26:41.969 --> 00:26:43.471
God had a plan.


00:26:43.572 --> 00:26:45.239
I know it's not just
about Plank, though.


00:26:45.339 --> 00:26:48.042
It's the whole network,
the whole business, really.


00:26:48.142 --> 00:26:50.244
I honestly don't wanna do it
anymore.


00:26:50.344 --> 00:26:51.846
Are you kidding?


00:26:51.946 --> 00:26:55.783
You have the biggest audience
in cable news.


00:26:55.883 --> 00:26:57.151
Yeah. Well, that would be
a good thing


00:26:57.251 --> 00:27:00.087
if I didn't have to put
air quotes from the word "news."


00:27:01.655 --> 00:27:04.425
Hey, look at these people,
right?


00:27:04.526 --> 00:27:07.194
They know who you are.
They trust you.


00:27:07.294 --> 00:27:09.363
They trust you even
if they've never met you.


00:27:09.463 --> 00:27:11.398
See, that's the problem.


00:27:11.499 --> 00:27:13.868
They trust me
to tell them the truth.


00:27:13.968 --> 00:27:16.670
But news is no longer
about truth.


00:27:16.770 --> 00:27:19.541
It's about a message and facts.


00:27:19.640 --> 00:27:20.875
It don't even matter anymore.


00:27:20.975 --> 00:27:23.077
I go on that show
every single night


00:27:23.177 --> 00:27:24.579
and lie to them
as if we're too afraid


00:27:24.678 --> 00:27:26.714
they can't handle the truth.


00:27:26.814 --> 00:27:29.950
-Hi.
-Hey. Yeah.


00:27:31.418 --> 00:27:33.420
Great.


00:27:36.790 --> 00:27:38.959
I used to love my job.


00:27:39.059 --> 00:27:43.164
I was an investigative
journalist for ten years.


00:27:43.264 --> 00:27:44.398
You know what I did?


00:27:44.498 --> 00:27:47.401
I investigated things
that needed to be investigated.


00:27:47.501 --> 00:27:51.438
And then I actually told people
about what I found.


00:27:51.540 --> 00:27:54.708
Poof.


00:27:56.944 --> 00:28:00.649
-And now?
-Now, I'm more like an actor.


00:28:00.748 --> 00:28:02.049
I do my lines.


00:28:02.149 --> 00:28:04.952
And depending on whatever story
we decide to report,


00:28:05.052 --> 00:28:10.157
I try to convince the world
that things are way, way better


00:28:10.257 --> 00:28:15.029
or far, far worse
than they actually are.


00:28:15.129 --> 00:28:18.132
I just feel like my audience
is smarter than that, you know?


00:28:18.232 --> 00:28:20.501
They're not a bunch
of religious wackos


00:28:20.602 --> 00:28:22.637
who are only looking
for easy answers


00:28:22.736 --> 00:28:24.905
and don't require facts
or two seconds


00:28:25.005 --> 00:28:26.473
of their own thought.


00:28:26.575 --> 00:28:27.708
Wackos like my mom?


00:28:27.808 --> 00:28:30.010
Chloe, no, I'm--
I didn't mean that.


00:28:30.110 --> 00:28:32.046
I just--I'm trying to process--


00:28:36.817 --> 00:28:38.719
- Are you seeing this?
- What is it?


00:28:38.819 --> 00:28:40.555
No, I can't believe it.


00:28:41.222 --> 00:28:43.724
Second wave? Here we go.


00:28:45.759 --> 00:28:48.095
I think I need to get
to the studio.


00:28:50.431 --> 00:28:52.366
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.


00:28:52.466 --> 00:28:54.134
Okay. I'll call you later.


00:28:54.235 --> 00:28:55.102
Let's go.


00:28:57.572 --> 00:29:00.908
Although there are plenty
of rumors and internet chatter,


00:29:01.008 --> 00:29:03.645
tracking down eyewitnesses
has actually been harder


00:29:03.744 --> 00:29:05.212
than we expected.


00:29:05.312 --> 00:29:06.113
One notable witness


00:29:06.213 --> 00:29:08.516
was apparently Senator,
Arthur Brandon.


00:29:08.617 --> 00:29:10.818
But while he has issued
a statement,


00:29:10.918 --> 00:29:13.887
he has so far been unwilling
to speak to the media.


00:29:13.988 --> 00:29:16.890
In fact, we've been having
a hard time tracking down anyone


00:29:16.991 --> 00:29:19.460
who's actually witnessed
the new vanishing.


00:29:19.561 --> 00:29:22.062
It's like, everybody knows
there was a second wave,


00:29:22.162 --> 00:29:24.965
but nobody's actually seen it
happen.


00:29:25.065 --> 00:29:28.002
So, Anna, while we wait
for our coverage


00:29:28.102 --> 00:29:30.004
of the UN press conference,


00:29:30.104 --> 00:29:31.405
what do you think about
all this?


00:29:31.506 --> 00:29:32.273
I believe him.


00:29:32.373 --> 00:29:34.775
He's a senator,
and he's a good man.


00:29:34.875 --> 00:29:36.645
Why would one of our own
government officials


00:29:36.745 --> 00:29:38.078
make something like that up?


00:29:38.178 --> 00:29:41.015
Just to scare us?
It's ridiculous.


00:29:41.115 --> 00:29:42.416
Well, just like last time.


00:29:42.517 --> 00:29:44.653
I mean, there weren't any
reports of unusual activity


00:29:44.753 --> 00:29:46.186
in the skies
around the Earth's orbit.


00:29:46.287 --> 00:29:49.423
So, are you still sticking
with the UFO theory?


00:29:49.524 --> 00:29:50.491
Of course.


00:29:50.592 --> 00:29:52.159
What else could have done
something like this?


00:29:52.259 --> 00:29:54.696
Many of the scientists
I spoke to


00:29:54.795 --> 00:29:56.864
Seem to think
that this is not the first time


00:29:56.964 --> 00:29:59.099
these vanishings have happened
on this planet.


00:29:59.199 --> 00:30:01.670
Certainly, the first time
any of us noticed.


00:30:01.770 --> 00:30:04.038
We're talking millions
of years ago,


00:30:04.138 --> 00:30:06.508
long before people
were recording history.


00:30:06.608 --> 00:30:09.076
In fact, it's probably
why there are gaping holes


00:30:09.176 --> 00:30:10.978
in the fossil record
showing the totality


00:30:11.078 --> 00:30:12.212
of human evolution.


00:30:12.313 --> 00:30:14.516
Well, maybe the UFOs have been
here many times.


00:30:14.616 --> 00:30:15.949
But then why has nobody
seen them?


00:30:16.050 --> 00:30:17.318
You just said
there was no one here


00:30:17.418 --> 00:30:19.119
to report the visits
millions of years ago.


00:30:19.219 --> 00:30:22.022
Okay. Reverend Pinkus,
what do you think?


00:30:22.122 --> 00:30:24.693
I mean, you originally stated
that the vanishings


00:30:24.793 --> 00:30:26.427
were the Christian Rapture.


00:30:26.528 --> 00:30:29.564
-I mean, is that so right?
-That's true.


00:30:29.664 --> 00:30:31.131
It was actually a bit scary.


00:30:31.231 --> 00:30:32.966
But so many Christians
are still here,


00:30:33.067 --> 00:30:34.569
and including hundreds
from my own church.


00:30:34.669 --> 00:30:38.005
There's no way that it could
have been the Rapture.


00:30:38.105 --> 00:30:39.206
Now, that doesn't mean


00:30:39.306 --> 00:30:41.875
that God didn't have his hand
in it, though.


00:30:41.975 --> 00:30:44.278
The Bible does teach
that God will send


00:30:44.378 --> 00:30:46.947
a powerful delusion
in the last days.


00:30:47.047 --> 00:30:49.718
And I personally believe
that this whole vanishing thing


00:30:49.818 --> 00:30:52.119
is part of that.


00:30:52.219 --> 00:30:56.323
Well, let's all try our best
not to add to those delusions.


00:30:56.423 --> 00:30:59.360
What about you, Buck?
What do you think?


00:31:00.294 --> 00:31:04.164
Well, the way I see it,
there's only one explanation


00:31:04.264 --> 00:31:07.635
that doesn't require an appeal
to an imaginary power,


00:31:07.736 --> 00:31:10.137
or unseen force.


00:31:10.237 --> 00:31:12.807
It's simply a new technology.


00:31:12.906 --> 00:31:14.908
I mean, you think we'd stop
being so surprised


00:31:15.008 --> 00:31:18.278
at what the human race
is capable of creating


00:31:18.379 --> 00:31:19.514
at this point.


00:31:19.614 --> 00:31:22.249
We all watched people disappear
on "Star Trek" growing up,


00:31:22.349 --> 00:31:25.052
communicators, translators,
Androids, robots,


00:31:25.152 --> 00:31:26.721
they're all realities now.


00:31:26.821 --> 00:31:28.989
So, why not
the transporter beam?


00:31:29.089 --> 00:31:31.191
So, you're saying
this is a man-made weapon?


00:31:31.291 --> 00:31:34.094
I never said it was a weapon.
I said technology.


00:31:34.194 --> 00:31:35.797
Arthur C. Clarke once said


00:31:35.896 --> 00:31:38.767
that any sufficiently
advanced technology


00:31:38.867 --> 00:31:41.435
is indistinguishable from magic.


00:31:42.236 --> 00:31:45.507
What I'd take away from that is
we don't need to look for magic


00:31:45.607 --> 00:31:48.342
just because we don't understand
how something works.


00:31:51.044 --> 00:31:52.479
I just got report
that we are about to begin


00:31:52.580 --> 00:31:54.749
our coverage
of the UN press conference.


00:31:55.884 --> 00:31:58.485
Less than a year ago,
if someone had told me


00:31:58.586 --> 00:32:01.455
that millions of people
were just gonna disappear,


00:32:01.556 --> 00:32:04.491
I, like you,
would have said they were crazy.


00:32:05.192 --> 00:32:07.327
Fast forward to today,


00:32:07.428 --> 00:32:10.998
and the unimaginable
has become real.


00:32:11.098 --> 00:32:12.332
And with the news
that the vanishings


00:32:12.433 --> 00:32:14.401
were not simply
a one-time event,


00:32:14.501 --> 00:32:17.404
we should all be reminded
that we have no choice


00:32:17.505 --> 00:32:20.340
but to face
this unprecedented threat


00:32:20.441 --> 00:32:21.676
together.


00:32:21.776 --> 00:32:25.212
Not as individual nation states
divided by rivers or mountains


00:32:25.312 --> 00:32:27.682
or thousands of years of war,


00:32:27.782 --> 00:32:31.151
but as one people
united at last.


00:32:35.557 --> 00:32:40.628
Fellow citizens of the world,
welcome to the future.


00:32:40.728 --> 00:32:43.063
Welcome to a new reality.


00:32:43.163 --> 00:32:47.134
A great reset, where we move
from a tribal mentality


00:32:47.234 --> 00:32:51.205
to united and unstoppable force
ready to face any challenge


00:32:51.305 --> 00:32:53.407
because
there is no greater power


00:32:53.508 --> 00:32:56.611
in the universe
than a unified human race.


00:32:59.781 --> 00:33:02.449
As you already know,
the second wave of vanishings,


00:33:02.550 --> 00:33:05.452
even though the extent
is not yet known,


00:33:05.553 --> 00:33:06.788
has thrown
the financial markets


00:33:06.888 --> 00:33:08.623
back into chaos.


00:33:08.723 --> 00:33:12.426
And while the major
stock exchanges quickly closed,


00:33:12.527 --> 00:33:14.161
the losses
were already catastrophic


00:33:14.261 --> 00:33:18.298
from panic selling
in every country in the world.


00:33:18.398 --> 00:33:21.503
The World Monetary Fund
has also issued a formal warning


00:33:21.603 --> 00:33:24.973
that more than 100 countries
will likely be bankrupt


00:33:25.072 --> 00:33:26.875
within 60 days.


00:33:26.975 --> 00:33:29.276
And within a year,
more than 90%


00:33:29.376 --> 00:33:33.648
of the world's citizens
will be living in poverty.


00:33:33.748 --> 00:33:36.216
Fortunately, we have a solution.


00:33:37.919 --> 00:33:41.288
And there it was,
surreal moment to say the least.


00:33:41.388 --> 00:33:43.190
One of the most powerful men
on the planet


00:33:43.290 --> 00:33:44.959
Standing in front
of the world


00:33:45.058 --> 00:33:47.060
and promising
a one world economy,


00:33:47.160 --> 00:33:48.863
a one world currency,


00:33:48.963 --> 00:33:51.098
and a path
to peace and prosperity.


00:33:51.198 --> 00:33:53.868
Exactly the system the Bible
told this was coming.


00:33:53.968 --> 00:33:58.171
And unsurprisingly, the people,
and especially the news media,


00:33:58.272 --> 00:33:59.741
just gobbled it up.


00:33:59.841 --> 00:34:01.843
Today,
under emergency conditions


00:34:01.943 --> 00:34:04.478
and with a nearly
unanimous consent,


00:34:04.579 --> 00:34:07.982
the United Nations has voted
to approve and mandate


00:34:08.081 --> 00:34:11.218
the electronic
payment technology known as OTM.


00:34:11.318 --> 00:34:13.688
Created by Israeli
Nobel Prize winner,


00:34:13.788 --> 00:34:16.123
Dr. Chaim Rosenzweig.


00:34:16.223 --> 00:34:18.325
Now, the reason
I'm part of this announcement


00:34:18.425 --> 00:34:22.062
is that Eden, the largest
social media platform ever,


00:34:22.162 --> 00:34:24.532
has agreed to make
all our resources


00:34:24.632 --> 00:34:27.067
available to the UN
free of charge


00:34:27.167 --> 00:34:29.102
in order to ensure
that we can implement


00:34:29.202 --> 00:34:32.372
Eden Pay worldwide
in a matter of weeks.


00:34:36.778 --> 00:34:38.913
Let me introduce the inventor


00:34:39.013 --> 00:34:41.214
on The Mark
Digital Technologies,


00:34:41.315 --> 00:34:43.918
Dr. Chaim Rosenzweig.


00:34:44.852 --> 00:34:46.955
Buck, you'll be the
first interview.


00:34:47.055 --> 00:34:48.455
Stand by.


00:34:48.556 --> 00:34:51.124
Ready studio
in three, two, one.


00:34:51.693 --> 00:34:54.328
Dr. Rosenzweig, so good
to see you again.


00:34:54.428 --> 00:34:57.097
Mr. Stonagal, thank you so much
for taking the time


00:34:57.197 --> 00:34:58.900
to be with us tonight.


00:34:59.000 --> 00:35:01.636
Now, this is a lot bigger news


00:35:01.736 --> 00:35:04.137
than I think most people
actually realize.


00:35:04.237 --> 00:35:06.874
I mean, Mr. Stonagal,
you must have jumped through


00:35:06.975 --> 00:35:08.042
a lot of hoops to get this


00:35:08.141 --> 00:35:10.243
to where it is at the UN,
correct?


00:35:10.344 --> 00:35:12.446
Well, there are some very
smart people


00:35:12.547 --> 00:35:14.481
and extremely powerful
positions around the world.


00:35:14.582 --> 00:35:17.619
And they see the need
and wisely recognize Eden Pay


00:35:17.719 --> 00:35:19.419
as the best solution.


00:35:19.520 --> 00:35:23.825
Now, you said that you had
essentially unanimous support


00:35:23.925 --> 00:35:25.693
from the UN membership.


00:35:25.793 --> 00:35:28.362
Can I assume
that essentially unanimous


00:35:28.462 --> 00:35:30.130
is different from unanimous?


00:35:30.230 --> 00:35:31.799
Well, a few of the members
have questions.


00:35:31.899 --> 00:35:33.433
And that's to be expected.


00:35:33.534 --> 00:35:35.670
Fortunately, none that
we can't answer.


00:35:35.770 --> 00:35:37.839
Do you mind telling us
who the holdouts are?


00:35:37.939 --> 00:35:40.942
All nations have formally
agreed with two exceptions;


00:35:41.042 --> 00:35:43.044
Romania and Israel.


00:35:43.143 --> 00:35:45.145
Interesting.


00:35:45.245 --> 00:35:48.448
Dr. Rosenzweig,
I'm a little confused by that.


00:35:48.549 --> 00:35:50.384
Why would Israel
be holding out?


00:35:50.484 --> 00:35:53.621
I mean, isn't Eden built
on Israeli technology?


00:35:53.721 --> 00:35:55.422
Israel has not signed
the agreement yet


00:35:55.523 --> 00:35:58.860
because there are deal terms
to be negotiated.


00:35:58.960 --> 00:36:00.427
Are those financial terms?


00:36:00.528 --> 00:36:02.329
No, no,
nothing of that sort.


00:36:02.429 --> 00:36:06.534
There are other issues involved,
including ongoing peace talks.


00:36:06.634 --> 00:36:09.369
We want to ensure
that Eden ushers in an era


00:36:09.469 --> 00:36:13.407
of peace for Israel,
and indeed for the entire world.


00:36:13.508 --> 00:36:18.680
So, we actually have peace
in the Middle East as a dealter.


00:36:19.312 --> 00:36:20.615
Wow.


00:36:22.249 --> 00:36:25.887
No. No. No way.


00:36:25.987 --> 00:36:30.223
Could you just get the victim
to come on camera and--


00:36:31.458 --> 00:36:34.796
No. All right, then we'll go
with the fake Jesus guy


00:36:34.896 --> 00:36:37.131
and make sure you get him
on camera taking credit


00:36:37.230 --> 00:36:38.365
for the new vanishings.


00:36:38.465 --> 00:36:41.268
Look, I got to go.
I've got to walk the dog.


00:36:41.368 --> 00:36:43.604
What's it to you? Goodbye.


00:36:46.140 --> 00:36:47.542
Tough day
at the ministry of truth?


00:36:47.642 --> 00:36:49.877
Can't you tell that
I'm not in the mood?


00:36:49.977 --> 00:36:52.013
I hate to be the one
to break it to you, Steve,


00:36:52.113 --> 00:36:54.816
but you always look like that.


00:36:54.916 --> 00:36:57.484
So... ...to recap,


00:36:57.585 --> 00:37:01.089
two days, after I have a guest
come on my show


00:37:01.189 --> 00:37:04.058
and predict
a second wave of vanishings,


00:37:04.158 --> 00:37:06.226
we have a second wave
of vanishings.


00:37:06.326 --> 00:37:07.427
It wasn't a prediction.


00:37:07.528 --> 00:37:10.765
She was simply reporting
what the model said.


00:37:10.865 --> 00:37:13.935
Computer spit out data,
people make predictions.


00:37:14.035 --> 00:37:15.570
Anyways, long story short,


00:37:15.670 --> 00:37:16.904
I decided to look
into her claims


00:37:17.004 --> 00:37:19.406
a little more carefully,
like I would have done


00:37:19.507 --> 00:37:21.008
before the show
had I actually known


00:37:21.109 --> 00:37:22.442
that you were gonna have her on.


00:37:22.543 --> 00:37:23.845
But thank you for that,
by the way.


00:37:23.945 --> 00:37:26.413
She's an interesting lady.
I'll give you that.


00:37:26.514 --> 00:37:29.717
She works closely with a man
named Joshua Todd-Cothran,


00:37:29.817 --> 00:37:32.920
who have actually heard
give his message on


00:37:33.020 --> 00:37:36.190
how he wants to introduce
a new world order.


00:37:36.289 --> 00:37:37.992
These people are obsessed
with the idea


00:37:38.092 --> 00:37:41.294
of having a one world government
that somehow will solve


00:37:41.394 --> 00:37:43.064
all poverty and wars.


00:37:43.164 --> 00:37:44.699
How dare they?


00:37:44.799 --> 00:37:48.069
Road to hell is paved
with good intentions, Steve.


00:37:48.169 --> 00:37:51.172
So, their plan
for several years now


00:37:51.271 --> 00:37:52.840
has been to create
an infrastructure


00:37:52.940 --> 00:37:56.409
for global order by it,
and this is the important part,


00:37:56.511 --> 00:37:58.679
by waiting
for a global catastrophe.


00:37:58.780 --> 00:38:00.615
And then they're gonna use
all the fear and uncertainty


00:38:00.715 --> 00:38:02.750
in the world to get people
to accept changes


00:38:02.850 --> 00:38:04.952
they never would have accepted
before the crisis.


00:38:05.052 --> 00:38:08.623
There is nothing new there.
And it certainly isn't news.


00:38:08.723 --> 00:38:10.457
Well, I'm not finished yet,
either.


00:38:10.558 --> 00:38:13.861
And then I have Dr. Kincaid
come on my show


00:38:13.961 --> 00:38:16.964
and said she has computer models
that are pointing towards


00:38:17.064 --> 00:38:18.465
a second wave of vanishing.


00:38:18.566 --> 00:38:21.434
So, she was right.
I guess you owe her an apology.


00:38:21.536 --> 00:38:23.436
Yeah. You think so.


00:38:23.538 --> 00:38:26.674
Except,
I'm not entirely convinced


00:38:26.774 --> 00:38:29.476
anyone vanishes this time
around.


00:38:29.577 --> 00:38:31.712
You see I was able to find
the source of the data


00:38:31.813 --> 00:38:34.248
that was
used to make that prediction.


00:38:34.347 --> 00:38:36.918
Ninety percent of it
came from one firm,


00:38:37.018 --> 00:38:40.855
Dominator Analytics,
owned by Joshua Todd-Cothran.


00:38:40.955 --> 00:38:43.925
So, we have a guy
who thinks we need to scare


00:38:44.025 --> 00:38:45.159
the hell out of people


00:38:45.259 --> 00:38:47.494
now scaring the hell
out of people.


00:38:47.595 --> 00:38:51.132
Buck, you don't have facts.
You're spitballing.


00:38:51.232 --> 00:38:54.068
He's not alone.
He's got a partner.


00:38:54.168 --> 00:38:56.804
Jonathan Stonagal.


00:38:56.904 --> 00:38:58.405
Yeah.


00:38:58.506 --> 00:39:01.876
So, these guys
whose fundamental mandate


00:39:01.976 --> 00:39:06.848
is to terrify people
not only announce a second wave


00:39:06.948 --> 00:39:09.550
in advance and then use their
own stats to back it up,


00:39:09.650 --> 00:39:11.285
but are now telling us
that they're gonna take over


00:39:11.384 --> 00:39:12.687
the World Bank.


00:39:12.787 --> 00:39:16.389
And we don't have a choice,
except to just go with it.


00:39:16.489 --> 00:39:17.792
Bottom line.


00:39:17.892 --> 00:39:19.492
I think
these new vanishing counts


00:39:19.594 --> 00:39:22.230
That we so proudly display
on all the screens


00:39:22.330 --> 00:39:25.633
during every broadcast
are probably fake.


00:39:31.305 --> 00:39:33.674
-Is that it?
-No, definitely not.


00:39:33.774 --> 00:39:35.877
I haven't even started
digging yet.


00:39:35.977 --> 00:39:37.912
You're not going to.


00:39:38.012 --> 00:39:39.479
Buck, I know.


00:39:39.580 --> 00:39:41.414
You've got
your beloved fan base.


00:39:41.515 --> 00:39:43.317
Yeah, you give them something
to chew on.


00:39:43.416 --> 00:39:44.952
But you say it every day
of the week.


00:39:45.052 --> 00:39:47.788
We are not
in the conspiracy business.


00:39:47.889 --> 00:39:49.957
Okay, Plank,
this isn't a conspiracy.


00:39:50.057 --> 00:39:52.927
This is the biggest news story
since the vanishings themselves.


00:39:53.027 --> 00:39:54.929
No, no, that is not
the big news story.


00:39:55.029 --> 00:39:57.430
The big news story is that
the world is suffering


00:39:57.531 --> 00:40:00.902
and we are teetering
on the brink of mass insanity.


00:40:01.002 --> 00:40:03.537
You start questioning the facts,
the only facts,


00:40:03.638 --> 00:40:06.173
the few facts
that we actually have,


00:40:06.274 --> 00:40:07.942
and you just make
everything worse.


00:40:09.310 --> 00:40:10.778
Okay Plank, listen to me.


00:40:10.878 --> 00:40:13.648
No, you know what,
you listen to me.


00:40:13.748 --> 00:40:17.018
You drag this line of nonsense
into the public eye.


00:40:17.118 --> 00:40:21.589
You and I, we're both finished
in the news business forever.


00:40:21.689 --> 00:40:22.857
I don't wanna hear another word
on this.


00:40:22.957 --> 00:40:25.593
You don't share any of it
with the staff.


00:40:25.693 --> 00:40:28.696
This conversation is over.
Are we clear?


00:40:29.530 --> 00:40:31.666
You're wrong about this one.


00:40:33.567 --> 00:40:35.970
Are we clear?


00:41:32.093 --> 00:41:33.995
Finally.


00:41:48.709 --> 00:41:51.012
Come on. This is crazy.


00:42:05.393 --> 00:42:08.029
I'm glad Ray didn't find
what he was looking for


00:42:08.129 --> 00:42:10.164
on Irene's phone.


00:42:10.264 --> 00:42:11.766
God's hand was on him,


00:42:11.866 --> 00:42:14.635
and he ended up right
where he needed to be.


00:42:22.576 --> 00:42:27.581
Jesus told us in the last days,
the world would hate Christians.


00:42:28.949 --> 00:42:30.351
The first rocks
through the window


00:42:30.451 --> 00:42:34.288
at New Hope came only about
an hour after the Rapture.


00:42:45.866 --> 00:42:48.669
So, why do people
who don't even believe in God


00:42:48.769 --> 00:42:51.205
suddenly hate him so much?


00:42:55.676 --> 00:42:58.446
Because they have no one else
to blame it on.


00:44:33.407 --> 00:44:35.109
Hello?


00:45:01.670 --> 00:45:05.306
Sometimes the hate exploded
into violence.


00:45:07.609 --> 00:45:10.811
And you know what?
Maybe I deserved it.


00:45:12.980 --> 00:45:15.015
If Ray hadn't shown up that day,


00:45:15.115 --> 00:45:17.718
who knows if I would have found
my way?


00:45:17.818 --> 00:45:18.886
Pastor Barnes?


00:45:18.986 --> 00:45:20.854
I may have given up on God,


00:45:20.955 --> 00:45:25.594
but I'm humbled to know
that God hadn't given up on me.


00:45:25.694 --> 00:45:27.696
How is it going, Ray?


00:46:10.705 --> 00:46:16.544
-No! No! No!
-Let go!


00:46:49.109 --> 00:46:51.345
But even in total darkness,


00:46:51.445 --> 00:46:55.482
God can find a way
to light the path,


00:46:55.583 --> 00:46:57.752
even with the faintest glint.


00:47:20.775 --> 00:47:24.512
It's the only thing
I could find.


00:47:24.612 --> 00:47:26.313
Thanks.


00:47:28.048 --> 00:47:31.753
-What happened here?
-A bunch of hooligans.


00:47:31.852 --> 00:47:34.254
Who can blame them?
They're scared.


00:47:35.356 --> 00:47:41.061
-So, are you okay?
-Yes, just my jaw.


00:47:41.161 --> 00:47:42.630
Yeah.


00:47:43.364 --> 00:47:45.299
So, what do I owe
this pleasure?


00:47:45.399 --> 00:47:47.769
It's not like you've ever been
a big fan of this place.


00:47:49.269 --> 00:47:51.071
Shouldn't I be the one
who's surprised


00:47:51.171 --> 00:47:54.475
-to see you here?
-I supposed so.


00:47:57.311 --> 00:47:58.946
What is it, Ray?


00:48:00.849 --> 00:48:04.151
Was it the Rapture?


00:48:05.419 --> 00:48:07.354
Yes. Yes, it was.


00:48:07.454 --> 00:48:10.592
Are you sure?
I mean, are you really sure?


00:48:10.692 --> 00:48:14.361
You know
what finally convinced me?


00:48:14.461 --> 00:48:17.030
When I saw it happen.


00:48:19.133 --> 00:48:23.805
-So, Irene and Rayme?
-They're fine, Ray.


00:48:23.904 --> 00:48:26.073
They're in heaven for eternity.


00:48:29.042 --> 00:48:32.881
-But then...
-Go ahead, Ray. You can ask.


00:48:32.980 --> 00:48:34.849
Why are you still here?


00:48:34.948 --> 00:48:38.853
Because I asked God
to leave me behind.


00:48:38.952 --> 00:48:41.288
I'm not done living my life
down here.


00:48:41.388 --> 00:48:44.859
So, I didn't want to leave
too soon.


00:48:44.958 --> 00:48:47.094
Is that good enough for you?


00:48:48.962 --> 00:48:51.599
It would be if it were true.


00:49:05.880 --> 00:49:07.882
-Chloe.
-Hi, Dr. White.


00:49:07.981 --> 00:49:10.984
- Hi.
- I just--


00:49:11.084 --> 00:49:12.085
What? My.


00:49:12.186 --> 00:49:13.688
Goodness,
what happened to you?


00:49:13.788 --> 00:49:16.023
-Come inside.
-Thank you.


00:49:17.191 --> 00:49:18.726
Come on upstairs.


00:49:20.662 --> 00:49:25.132
Well, this looks pretty angry.
But it's fairly shallow.


00:49:25.232 --> 00:49:27.602
No stitches required.


00:49:27.702 --> 00:49:29.236
I'll just give it a good rinse


00:49:29.336 --> 00:49:31.873
and apply
some topical antibiotic,


00:49:31.972 --> 00:49:34.609
which should also help
with the pain.


00:49:36.243 --> 00:49:39.514
-Thanks, Dr. White.
-Aw. Amanda.


00:49:43.450 --> 00:49:45.118
Hi, Fern.


00:49:45.920 --> 00:49:48.121
Chloe, this is Fern.


00:49:48.222 --> 00:49:50.859
Fern, this is Irene's daughter.


00:49:55.830 --> 00:49:58.131
Honey, I'm on borrowed time.


00:49:58.232 --> 00:50:02.604
So, I'm just gonna say it.
You messed up big.


00:50:13.615 --> 00:50:15.950
Ray wanted to talk
about prophecy.


00:50:16.049 --> 00:50:18.553
And who could blame him?


00:50:18.653 --> 00:50:21.088
His wife told him the Rapture
was going to happen.


00:50:21.188 --> 00:50:22.155
And it did.


00:50:22.256 --> 00:50:24.358
So, of course, he was curious.


00:50:26.661 --> 00:50:28.262
Me, on the other hand,


00:50:28.362 --> 00:50:30.565
I guess I was just still
pouting and feeling sorry


00:50:30.665 --> 00:50:32.232
for myself.


00:50:33.233 --> 00:50:36.436
But Ray managed to drag me
into his little Bible study


00:50:36.538 --> 00:50:39.774
with what he would later admit
was an intentional mistake.


00:50:39.874 --> 00:50:41.943
Seven.


00:50:42.042 --> 00:50:44.579
It's not six years, it's seven.


00:50:46.113 --> 00:50:49.316
Tribulation doesn't start
when the Rapture happens.


00:50:49.416 --> 00:50:51.686
The seven-year clock
doesn't start counting down


00:50:51.786 --> 00:50:54.856
till there's a signing
of a seven-year peace agreement


00:50:54.956 --> 00:50:57.692
between Israel
and their enemies.


00:50:59.326 --> 00:51:01.763
And you know what else
you find out on that day?


00:51:01.863 --> 00:51:03.698
What?


00:51:03.798 --> 00:51:05.800
Who the Antichrist is.


00:51:07.434 --> 00:51:10.203
He's the one that confirms
the treaty.


00:51:10.304 --> 00:51:13.373
Until then,
his identity is anybody's guess.


00:51:15.275 --> 00:51:17.210
So then,
who is this Antichrist?


00:51:17.311 --> 00:51:18.846
I mean, is it Satan?


00:51:18.947 --> 00:51:20.080
Not exactly.


00:51:20.180 --> 00:51:23.417
The Antichrist
is Satan's counterfeit, Jesus.


00:51:23.518 --> 00:51:25.920
He was sent here
to lie and deceive.


00:51:26.020 --> 00:51:28.288
He'd say one thing
and then he'll--


00:51:28.388 --> 00:51:31.659
you know what, forget it.
I can't do this.


00:51:31.759 --> 00:51:33.260
What do you mean?


00:51:33.360 --> 00:51:36.798
Who am I to tell you
what to believe?


00:51:37.999 --> 00:51:40.267
You know this stuff.


00:51:40.367 --> 00:51:43.270
I never believed it.
None of it.


00:51:43.370 --> 00:51:47.240
I talked about God all the time.


00:51:47.341 --> 00:51:49.844
I guess I was just
one of those false teachers


00:51:49.944 --> 00:51:53.815
that the Bible says
who show up in the last days.


00:51:53.915 --> 00:51:58.185
We both made mistakes.
So, how about we unmake them?


00:52:02.222 --> 00:52:04.157
All right.


00:52:05.325 --> 00:52:08.195
Look, I think
we both believe this now.


00:52:08.295 --> 00:52:09.530
We missed our chance.


00:52:09.631 --> 00:52:12.299
But so did everyone else
who's still here.


00:52:12.399 --> 00:52:14.902
They need to know the truth.


00:52:15.003 --> 00:52:18.438
Look around, no one comes here.


00:52:18.539 --> 00:52:20.875
No one's been here in months.


00:52:20.975 --> 00:52:23.878
They don't want the truth.


00:52:24.712 --> 00:52:26.714
One of them might.


00:52:29.751 --> 00:52:31.653
That should be enough.


00:52:33.320 --> 00:52:35.255
You're right.


00:52:42.897 --> 00:52:44.966
Start with this.


00:52:45.198 --> 00:52:46.299
<i>Hello.</i>


00:52:46.400 --> 00:52:47.769
<i>My name is Vernon Billings,</i>


00:52:47.869 --> 00:52:50.872
<i>and I'm the lead pastor</i>
<i>at the New Hope Church.</i>


00:52:50.972 --> 00:52:54.709
<i>I'm recording this as a message</i>
<i>for all those left behind</i>


00:52:54.809 --> 00:52:57.045
<i>after the return of Christ</i>
<i>in the air</i>


00:52:57.145 --> 00:53:01.049
<i>to call his church home</i>
<i>in the Rapture.</i>


00:53:01.149 --> 00:53:03.051
<i>For all of you</i>
<i>who lost loved ones,</i>


00:53:03.151 --> 00:53:04.952
<i>among the millions</i>
<i>that vanished,</i>


00:53:05.053 --> 00:53:09.023
<i>please, be assured,</i>
<i>they are fine.</i>


00:53:09.123 --> 00:53:11.458
<i>You have my word on that.</i>


00:53:11.559 --> 00:53:13.360
Are you trying to scare me?


00:53:13.460 --> 00:53:16.496
-Perhaps, Chloe--
-Perhaps, Chloe, what?


00:53:16.597 --> 00:53:19.366
Needs everything sugar-coated
for her?


00:53:19.466 --> 00:53:22.302
I think that's what got her
here in the first place.


00:53:22.402 --> 00:53:25.039
- I'm sorry?
- You should be.


00:53:25.740 --> 00:53:29.276
Don't you act all tough with me,
Chloe Steele.


00:53:29.376 --> 00:53:33.147
I had a mama
who worshipped to drink


00:53:33.246 --> 00:53:36.684
and throw me out on
the street at 12.


00:53:36.784 --> 00:53:39.286
- Okay, what exactly did I do?
- Do?


00:53:39.386 --> 00:53:42.322
I'm so glad
you asked that question.


00:53:42.422 --> 00:53:44.424
Your mom was a friend of mine.


00:53:44.525 --> 00:53:48.062
And she made it her mission
to ensure that we all know


00:53:48.162 --> 00:53:52.265
the answer to the question
that everybody is asking now.


00:53:52.365 --> 00:53:55.502
I just never thought
I would see the daughter


00:53:55.603 --> 00:54:00.007
of Irene Steele left behind.


00:54:00.108 --> 00:54:02.009
I see.


00:54:04.444 --> 00:54:09.050
So, if you both listened
to my mom,


00:54:09.150 --> 00:54:10.317
then why are you still here?


00:54:12.120 --> 00:54:15.355
Child. You in it now.


00:54:19.026 --> 00:54:22.997
<i>The Apostle Paul</i>
<i>wrote to the church at Corinth,</i>


00:54:23.097 --> 00:54:26.567
<i>"Behold, I tell you a mystery.</i>


00:54:26.667 --> 00:54:31.404
We shall not all sleep,
but shall be changed in a moment


00:54:31.506 --> 00:54:35.543
in the twinkling of an eye."


00:54:35.643 --> 00:54:38.112
Unfortunately,
if you are watching this


00:54:38.212 --> 00:54:39.680
after the Rapture,


00:54:39.781 --> 00:54:43.483
then you are either in
or soon to be in.


00:54:43.584 --> 00:54:46.687
A seven-year period
of darkness, tribulation,


00:54:46.788 --> 00:54:50.191
And terror like the world
has never seen.


00:54:51.192 --> 00:54:57.198
Please, I beg you, abandon
your self-centered ideals.


00:54:57.665 --> 00:55:02.603
No matter what you have to face
on Earth, it's not too late.


00:55:02.703 --> 00:55:06.774
You can still spend eternity
in heaven.


00:55:08.075 --> 00:55:09.577
Turn to the Bible.


00:55:09.677 --> 00:55:14.782
Turn to God, not because
you have no other choice,


00:55:14.882 --> 00:55:17.852
but because
this is the right choice.


00:55:19.153 --> 00:55:21.889
Turn to God. I beg you.


00:55:21.989 --> 00:55:26.093
Take this opportunity
and embrace these words.


00:55:26.194 --> 00:55:30.765
Get on your knees and thank God
for this second chance.


00:55:40.041 --> 00:55:42.076
Ray knew
that studying Bible prophecy


00:55:42.176 --> 00:55:43.244
was not enough.


00:55:43.343 --> 00:55:45.412
Heck, I was living proof
of that.


00:55:45.513 --> 00:55:47.615
I knew that stuff inside out.


00:55:47.715 --> 00:55:49.617
I could have written a book
about the Rapture.


00:55:49.717 --> 00:55:53.588
And yet, there I was.
The gift of salvation is free.


00:55:53.688 --> 00:55:56.557
You can't earn it.
You can't deserve it.


00:55:56.657 --> 00:55:59.794
You just have to ask
and receive.


00:55:59.894 --> 00:56:03.363
I'd have laughed if you told me
that one day Rayford Steele


00:56:03.463 --> 00:56:06.167
would be leading me
to the altar.


00:56:06.267 --> 00:56:08.468
Thank you, Jesus.


00:56:11.873 --> 00:56:14.474
<i>I want you to repeat</i>
<i>these words,</i>


00:56:14.575 --> 00:56:18.546
<i>and to think about each word</i>
<i>as you say it.</i>


00:56:18.646 --> 00:56:21.883
<i>Lord Jesus,</i>
<i>I know I am a sinner.</i>


00:56:21.983 --> 00:56:24.919
Lord Jesus,
I know I'm a sinner.


00:56:25.019 --> 00:56:28.022
<i>But I also know</i>
<i>that you have offered me</i>


00:56:28.122 --> 00:56:30.858
<i>the gift of your forgiveness.</i>


00:56:30.958 --> 00:56:33.194
But I also know
that you have offered me


00:56:33.294 --> 00:56:34.629
the gift of your forgiveness.


00:56:34.729 --> 00:56:37.098
<i>You gave your life for me,</i>


00:56:37.198 --> 00:56:40.400
<i>and then rose from the dead</i>
<i>on the third day.</i>


00:56:40.500 --> 00:56:42.036
You gave your life for me,


00:56:42.136 --> 00:56:44.538
and then rose from the dead
on the third day.


00:56:44.639 --> 00:56:49.644
<i>I gratefully accept</i>
<i>your offer of salvation.</i>


00:56:49.744 --> 00:56:52.747
I gratefully accept your offer
of salvation.


00:56:52.847 --> 00:56:56.083
<i>Please, Lord,</i>
<i>come into my heart</i>


00:56:56.183 --> 00:56:58.386
<i>as my Lord and Savior.</i>


00:56:58.485 --> 00:57:01.022
Please, Lord,
come into my heart


00:57:01.122 --> 00:57:03.024
as my Lord and Savior.


00:57:04.125 --> 00:57:06.459
<i>Thank you, Jesus.</i>


00:57:07.460 --> 00:57:09.196
<i>Amen.</i>


00:57:11.999 --> 00:57:13.567
Amen.


00:57:14.635 --> 00:57:16.103
Well, what about
the main server?


00:57:16.203 --> 00:57:18.372
-Any luck?
- <i>No way.</i>


00:57:18.471 --> 00:57:19.840
<i>Not without password.</i>


00:57:19.941 --> 00:57:21.709
Well, we'll keep trying anyway.


00:57:25.179 --> 00:57:27.615
Come on, come on, come on.


00:57:27.715 --> 00:57:30.885
Aha.


00:57:32.452 --> 00:57:35.623
Shoot, shoot, shoot,
shoot, shoot.


00:57:42.330 --> 00:57:44.265
Hey, Chloe, where are you?


00:57:45.099 --> 00:57:46.334
I didn't even know
your mother's place


00:57:46.434 --> 00:57:48.736
is still running.


00:57:48.836 --> 00:57:51.906
No, no, I'm fine.
I'm fine.


00:57:52.006 --> 00:57:54.474
I just wanted to do a talk
about something.


00:57:54.575 --> 00:57:57.078
I know you might not be ready
for this.


00:57:57.178 --> 00:57:58.746
But I saw something today.


00:57:58.846 --> 00:58:01.949
And I really want you
to see it too.


00:58:03.451 --> 00:58:04.452
Well, what if it is about God?


00:58:04.552 --> 00:58:09.156
I mean, what does--
Chloe, please.


00:58:12.193 --> 00:58:13.995
Okay, yeah, fine.


00:58:14.095 --> 00:58:17.064
I'll call you tomorrow.


00:58:19.066 --> 00:58:20.868
Yeah, I love you too.


00:58:23.938 --> 00:58:25.406
Don't you think
your dad would wanna know


00:58:25.506 --> 00:58:27.141
you got hurt?


00:58:28.209 --> 00:58:30.778
I need a doctor. Not a priest.


00:58:30.878 --> 00:58:34.749
Girl, you need to honor
thy Father.


00:59:22.830 --> 00:59:25.199
And what is this?
What do you want?


00:59:56.730 --> 00:59:59.934
Yes.


01:00:07.908 --> 01:00:09.944
-Hi, Ray.
-Hattie.


01:00:10.044 --> 01:00:11.045
How are you?


01:00:11.145 --> 01:00:14.048
I'm good.


01:00:16.784 --> 01:00:20.921
So, please-- I'm sorry,
why don't you come on in inside?


01:00:21.021 --> 01:00:24.225
I'm so glad to see
that you're all right.


01:00:24.325 --> 01:00:25.092
Yeah.


01:00:25.192 --> 01:00:26.060
I mean, I'm better than
all right.


01:00:26.160 --> 01:00:28.729
- It's been good.
- Yeah.


01:00:30.998 --> 01:00:32.633
I just really wanted to see you.


01:00:32.733 --> 01:00:33.934
You know, I've been thinking
so much about you


01:00:34.034 --> 01:00:35.769
and I've been thinking about us.


01:00:35.870 --> 01:00:37.506
Yeah. You know,
I meant to call but--


01:00:37.606 --> 01:00:40.007
It's okay.
You don't owe me an apology.


01:00:41.510 --> 01:00:42.710
Can I get you a drink,
or something?


01:00:42.810 --> 01:00:43.978
I would love one. Thanks.


01:00:44.078 --> 01:00:47.781
-What can I get you?
-Whatever you have.


01:00:49.183 --> 01:00:51.520
I left the airline.


01:00:51.620 --> 01:00:54.155
Really? To do what?


01:00:54.255 --> 01:00:55.723
I got a job at the UN.


01:00:55.823 --> 01:00:57.791
I'm gonna be working
with the Romanian Ambassador,


01:00:57.892 --> 01:00:59.660
Nicolae Carpathia.


01:00:59.760 --> 01:01:02.696
Wow. That sounds great.


01:01:02.796 --> 01:01:04.732
I mean, it could be great
for both of us.


01:01:04.832 --> 01:01:06.867
You know, the UN is having
trouble getting negotiators


01:01:06.967 --> 01:01:08.469
and diplomatic teams out
fast enough,


01:01:08.570 --> 01:01:10.938
and they're short on pilots.


01:01:11.038 --> 01:01:15.009
I'm not looking for a job.


01:01:15.109 --> 01:01:16.578
-But thanks.
-Seriously?


01:01:16.677 --> 01:01:17.778
I mean, they're paying so well.


01:01:17.878 --> 01:01:19.980
You'll help the world get back
on its feet.


01:01:20.080 --> 01:01:21.882
Not to mention
you'll have an amazing co-worker


01:01:21.982 --> 01:01:23.751
with a lot of benefits.


01:01:24.752 --> 01:01:26.220
Hattie...


01:01:28.590 --> 01:01:30.391
I can't.


01:01:38.832 --> 01:01:41.302
I've got to stop living
in the past, Ray.


01:01:41.402 --> 01:01:43.605
You have to stop worrying
about the vanishings


01:01:43.704 --> 01:01:45.005
