vanishing since then.


01:01:55.849 --> 01:01:57.818
Do you know anyone
who's gone in the second wave?


01:01:57.918 --> 01:01:59.621
Not personally.


01:01:59.720 --> 01:02:01.455
It's because the Raptures
weren't debunked.


01:02:01.556 --> 01:02:03.924
And someone on TV told you
that they were debunked


01:02:04.024 --> 01:02:07.194
