01:03:52.066 --> 01:03:53.133
Let's just say
someone on the inside


01:03:53.233 --> 01:03:55.570
thinks the world needs
to see this.


01:03:55.670 --> 01:03:56.571
And so do you.


01:04:07.014 --> 01:04:08.015
Well, Megan, as you can see,


01:04:08.115 --> 01:04:10.084
