01:04:18.992 --> 01:04:20.127
But for a politician,


01:04:20.227 --> 01:04:23.163
I haven't seen
anything like this since Obama.


01:04:23.263 --> 01:04:24.965
I mean, listen to that crowd.


01:04:25.065 --> 01:04:27.535
After all the incredible work
he did in Romania


01:04:27.635 --> 01:04:28.803
after the vanishings,


01:04:28.902 --> 01:04:30.739
the world is looking
for someone they can trust


01:04:30.839 --> 01:04:32.306
