Carpathia.


01:06:45.138 --> 01:06:47.241
It's going global.


01:06:47.942 --> 01:06:49.711
I swear
she's trying to take my job.


01:06:49.811 --> 01:06:51.311
Yeah, obviously.


01:06:51.411 --> 01:06:53.848
Okay. So, I found
a treasure trove of evidence


01:06:53.948 --> 01:06:55.215
