01:07:08.830 --> 01:07:09.496
I'm on it.


01:07:10.665 --> 01:07:11.799
<i>We have a couple over times...</i>


01:07:11.900 --> 01:07:13.233
Okay.


01:07:13.333 --> 01:07:14.501
