<i>But in the heart of it all,</i>
<i>we're still the world.</i>


01:07:19.439 --> 01:07:23.277
<i>One world, one people,</i>
<i>one future.</i>


01:07:23.377 --> 01:07:25.813
<i>That's not just</i>
<i>a hopeful mantra.</i>


