<i>to ensure the survival,</i>


01:07:29.751 --> 01:07:33.387
<i>not only of our species,</i>
<i>but of this incredible planet</i>


01:07:33.487 --> 01:07:36.256
<i>that grew and evolved</i>
<i>against incredible odds</i>


01:07:36.356 --> 01:07:39.027
<i>in this marvelous place</i>
<i>that we call home.</i>


01:07:40.260 --> 01:07:42.797
<i>Progress is not something</i>
<i>that happens gradually.</i>


01:07:42.897 --> 01:07:46.734
<i>It becomes invisible starts,</i>
<i>sometimes for the better,</i>


01:07:46.834 --> 01:07:48.402
<i>sometimes for the worse.</i>


01:07:48.502 --> 01:07:50.370
<i>So, it is absolutely critical</i>


01:07:50.470 --> 01:07:52.372
