This is an email that was part
of an internal memo


01:13:11.559 --> 01:13:13.694
sent in the IT department.


01:13:14.394 --> 01:13:15.495
Wait, this memo was sent


01:13:15.596 --> 01:13:18.332
before the second vanishings
were reported?


01:13:18.431 --> 01:13:19.967
Over a week ago.


01:13:21.102 --> 01:13:23.271
That's it. That's our answer.


01:13:23.371 --> 01:13:24.639
It was faked.


01:13:24.739 --> 01:13:26.707
My guess is these people
never even existed.


01:13:26.807 --> 01:13:29.442
We need to see your guy,
and I'm coming with you.


01:13:29.543 --> 01:13:30.845
This might be my last chance
to talk to him


01:13:30.945 --> 01:13:33.514
before word gets out
and I lost my show.


01:13:33.614 --> 01:13:34.882
Wait, you lost your show?


01:13:39.020 --> 01:13:40.321
My guy should be here.


01:13:56.404 --> 01:13:57.470
Connor.


01:13:57.571 --> 01:13:58.639
Thanks for doing this, man.


01:13:58.739 --> 01:14:00.107
Yeah, thanks for thinking of me.


01:14:00.207 --> 01:14:01.609
Of course.


01:14:01.709 --> 01:14:04.245
Hey, look, I want to make sure
that we do a real-time upload


01:14:04.345 --> 01:14:05.746
of the interview to the cloud.


01:14:05.846 --> 01:14:07.114
Make sure
we don't lose anything, okay?


01:14:07.214 --> 01:14:08.082
Okay.


01:14:08.182 --> 01:14:09.417
Dirk, Connor. Connor, Dirk.


01:14:09.517 --> 01:14:10.450
- Hi.
- Hey, Connor.


01:14:10.551 --> 01:14:12.353
Nice to meet you, yeah.


01:14:12.452 --> 01:14:13.521
You have everything you need?


01:14:13.621 --> 01:14:15.523
Yeah, let me just double-check
this box,


01:14:15.623 --> 01:14:17.091
make sure I have
the right cable.


01:14:17.191 --> 01:14:19.427
I have eyes on the vehicle.


01:14:19.560 --> 01:14:21.729
Both targets confirmed.


01:14:23.164 --> 01:14:24.098
Yes, sir.


01:14:25.299 --> 01:14:26.534
We have a couple more bags.


01:14:26.634 --> 01:14:27.635
Would you mind putting
the seats down?


01:14:27.735 --> 01:14:30.237
-You got it.
-Thanks.


01:14:30.338 --> 01:14:31.639
-So, you're through?
-Yeah.


01:14:37.578 --> 01:14:39.413
It's a bomb! Run! Run!


01:14:51.292 --> 01:14:53.761
No!


01:14:57.431 --> 01:15:00.768
What about all the evidence
debunking the Rapture theory?


01:15:00.868 --> 01:15:02.570
Lots of Christians still here.


01:15:02.670 --> 01:15:04.505
Lots of non-Christians gone.


01:15:04.605 --> 01:15:05.773
And don't forget this,


01:15:05.873 --> 01:15:07.441
this didn't happen
in the twinkling of an eye.


01:15:07.541 --> 01:15:10.277
In fact,
it's still happening now.


01:15:10.378 --> 01:15:12.913
-They're lying.
-Who's lying?


01:15:13.014 --> 01:15:15.316
Anyone who tells you this
wasn't in the Rapture.


01:15:15.416 --> 01:15:16.984
That's who.


01:15:17.084 --> 01:15:19.854
When the disciples asked Jesus
on the Mount of Olives


01:15:19.954 --> 01:15:22.156
what life would be like
in the last days,


01:15:22.256 --> 01:15:23.591
his first words were,


01:15:23.691 --> 01:15:26.360
"Take heed
that no man deceive you."


01:15:26.460 --> 01:15:29.130
So, how do we know
who we can trust?


01:15:29.230 --> 01:15:30.898
Trust God.


01:15:30.998 --> 01:15:32.466
Trust Jesus.


01:15:32.566 --> 01:15:33.768
Trust the Bible.


01:15:33.868 --> 01:15:35.770
And for literally,
everyone else,


01:15:35.870 --> 01:15:38.873
take what they're saying to you
and weighed against the word.


01:15:38.973 --> 01:15:44.178
And then you pray, pray,
pray for God's help


01:15:44.278 --> 01:15:46.614
not to be led astray.


01:15:46.714 --> 01:15:50.484
So, if this is the Rapture,


01:15:50.584 --> 01:15:52.586
then what happens
to the rest of us


01:15:52.686 --> 01:15:54.121
who didn't make the cut?


01:15:54.221 --> 01:15:57.425
Well, hopefully,
we survive tribulation.


01:15:57.526 --> 01:15:59.160
That's what the Rapture
was all about.


01:15:59.260 --> 01:16:02.463
Jesus taken his church
to heaven to protect them


01:16:02.563 --> 01:16:03.464
from what is to come.


01:16:03.564 --> 01:16:05.132
And what is that exactly?


01:16:05.232 --> 01:16:07.301
Well, we don't want to go
into the gory details.


01:16:07.401 --> 01:16:09.804
-Let's just--
-No, I want to know.


01:16:11.005 --> 01:16:15.042
When it is all over,
half the world will be dead.


01:16:15.142 --> 01:16:16.177
Wow.


01:16:16.277 --> 01:16:19.046
So, I don't know whether
I'd be more afraid of God


01:16:19.146 --> 01:16:20.114
or the Antichrist.


01:16:20.214 --> 01:16:21.582
God, definitely.


01:16:21.682 --> 01:16:24.051
You can hide
from the Antichrist.


01:16:24.151 --> 01:16:27.221
What about all the people
who claim that the Rapture


01:16:27.321 --> 01:16:29.090
isn't even in the Bible?


01:16:29.590 --> 01:16:31.692
Can you show me where it is?


01:16:34.628 --> 01:16:38.899
First Thessalonians,
Chapter Four.


01:16:38.999 --> 01:16:43.370
"For the Lord shall descend
from heaven with a shout,


01:16:43.471 --> 01:16:45.639
with the voice of the archangel,


01:16:45.739 --> 01:16:48.142
and the dead in Christ
shall rise first.


01:16:48.242 --> 01:16:50.711
Then we,
which are alive and remain,


01:16:50.811 --> 01:16:53.347
shall be gathered up with them
in the clouds


01:16:53.447 --> 01:16:55.483
to meet our Lord in the air.


01:16:55.584 --> 01:16:58.419
And so shall ever be
with the Lord."


01:16:58.520 --> 01:17:01.055
Sounds good to me.


01:17:01.155 --> 01:17:04.425
I can't wait to see
my dearly departed, George,


01:17:04.526 --> 01:17:06.595
waiting for me.


01:17:07.928 --> 01:17:11.065
-I'll be back tonight.
-Where are you going?


01:17:11.165 --> 01:17:14.068
Just have an old friend
I need to check on.


01:17:23.477 --> 01:17:24.546
Well, I don't understand.


01:17:24.645 --> 01:17:26.548
Why wouldn't you support
the Eden Project?


01:17:27.381 --> 01:17:29.650
First off,
I love the technology.


01:17:29.750 --> 01:17:32.219
I mean, you've done
a brilliant job.


01:17:32.319 --> 01:17:33.954
It's incredibly intuitive.


01:17:34.054 --> 01:17:36.690
Any man or woman almost
anywhere in the world


01:17:36.790 --> 01:17:39.460
will master it almost
from the first touch.


01:17:39.561 --> 01:17:40.494
Brilliant.


01:17:40.595 --> 01:17:42.531
Much appreciated, Nicolae.


01:17:42.631 --> 01:17:45.232
And you, Jonathan,
for your foresight


01:17:45.332 --> 01:17:48.102
and financial backing
to make it happen.


01:17:48.202 --> 01:17:52.139
Without you, none of this
would have been possible.


01:17:54.008 --> 01:17:55.943
Chaim, if you could give us
a minute, please.


01:17:56.043 --> 01:17:57.678
Of course.


01:17:59.180 --> 01:18:01.415
I know it all sounds
a little scary.


01:18:01.516 --> 01:18:03.150
A little scary?


01:18:03.250 --> 01:18:05.686
Then what would a lot scary
found like?


01:18:05.786 --> 01:18:07.154
So, when does all this happen?


01:18:07.254 --> 01:18:09.624
I mean, are stars gonna fall
from the sky the moment


01:18:09.723 --> 01:18:11.458
the peace treaty is signed?


01:18:11.560 --> 01:18:13.294
No, we still have a little time.


01:18:13.394 --> 01:18:15.664
The judgment won't start
until the midpoint


01:18:15.763 --> 01:18:17.731
Of the Seven Years
of Tribulation,


01:18:17.831 --> 01:18:21.435
then the Antichrist
will declare himself as God.


01:18:21.536 --> 01:18:23.605
I know these political fellas


01:18:23.704 --> 01:18:25.973
have pretty high opinions
of themselves.


01:18:26.073 --> 01:18:29.977
But claiming to be God seemed
like a stretch even for them.


01:18:30.077 --> 01:18:31.712
You would think so.


01:18:31.812 --> 01:18:34.148
But the entire world
will buy into it.


01:18:34.248 --> 01:18:37.318
They will fall down
and worship him.


01:18:37.418 --> 01:18:38.852
Really?


01:18:44.992 --> 01:18:46.661
Buck may have lost
one of his oldest friends


01:18:46.794 --> 01:18:48.162
that day.


01:18:48.262 --> 01:18:50.965
But he knew there was no time
to waste feeling bad about it.


01:18:51.065 --> 01:18:52.567
First of all,
nobody gets in here.


01:18:52.667 --> 01:18:54.868
The stakes were much higher
than one man's death.


01:18:54.969 --> 01:18:56.937
And Buck knew that
he had to get Dirk's computer


01:18:57.037 --> 01:18:58.339
before the FBI found it


01:18:58.439 --> 01:19:01.141
and buried it
in a warehouse somewhere.


01:19:01.242 --> 01:19:02.343
You know the one.


01:19:03.077 --> 01:19:04.812
When he arrived
at the university,


01:19:04.912 --> 01:19:06.780
They were still cleaning out
Dirk's office


01:19:06.880 --> 01:19:09.183
and probably trying to crack
that safe.


01:19:09.283 --> 01:19:13.287
Had almost managed to give Buck
a smile. Almost.


01:19:13.754 --> 01:19:15.456
Right now though,
all that matters


01:19:15.557 --> 01:19:18.359
was getting that laptop
and making sure Dirk's death


01:19:18.459 --> 01:19:20.494
was not going to be in vain.


01:19:32.373 --> 01:19:35.809
- Track his buddy.
- He's in this building somewhere.


01:19:37.811 --> 01:19:39.313
Shit.


01:19:41.315 --> 01:19:43.984
- There he is.
- We got him.


01:19:56.230 --> 01:19:57.131
Stairs.


01:20:06.373 --> 01:20:07.676
Out of the, Hercules.


01:20:17.786 --> 01:20:19.453
The dumpster?


01:20:19.554 --> 01:20:20.387
Just in case.


01:20:24.825 --> 01:20:26.493
Let's get out of here.


01:20:27.796 --> 01:20:29.463
Let him get away.


01:21:05.466 --> 01:21:07.034
Great.


01:21:10.104 --> 01:21:13.340
I love the platform.
It's just too dangerous.


01:21:13.440 --> 01:21:14.341
But, Nicolae--


01:21:14.441 --> 01:21:16.578
I trust you both
and I'm completely convinced


01:21:16.678 --> 01:21:20.047
that the platform will provide
the hope that you say it well.


01:21:21.014 --> 01:21:23.518
And you had me
at a disadvantage, friend.


01:21:23.618 --> 01:21:25.352
Why the hesitation?


01:21:25.452 --> 01:21:29.824
You're a good man, Jonathan.
I know this.


01:21:29.923 --> 01:21:30.924
And believe me,


01:21:31.024 --> 01:21:32.926
I'm a very good judge
of character.


01:21:33.026 --> 01:21:34.261
And if I wasn't
completely convinced


01:21:34.361 --> 01:21:36.330
that your motives were pure,


01:21:36.430 --> 01:21:38.800
I would have never considered
any of this.


01:21:38.899 --> 01:21:42.503
Well, I appreciate the trust.
But?


01:21:42.604 --> 01:21:44.938
What if this were to fall
in the wrong hands?


01:21:45.038 --> 01:21:46.206
What do you mean?


01:21:46.306 --> 01:21:48.108
Something were to happen to
you,


01:21:48.208 --> 01:21:51.044
do you have a successor
in place?


01:21:51.145 --> 01:21:53.280
Now I understand.


01:21:54.181 --> 01:21:55.182
You'll be pleased to know


01:21:55.282 --> 01:21:57.117
that I've already chosen
a successor.


01:21:57.217 --> 01:22:01.388
And no one can persuade me
otherwise, not even you.


01:22:01.488 --> 01:22:03.056
My choice is final.


01:22:03.157 --> 01:22:06.694
And might I ask,
who would that be?


01:22:06.795 --> 01:22:09.864
Well, you, of course.


01:22:18.305 --> 01:22:21.942
<i>You have one new voice message.</i>


01:22:22.042 --> 01:22:23.645
<i>First message.</i>


01:22:23.745 --> 01:22:26.815
<i>Mr. Williams, there's something</i>
<i>going on here.</i>


01:22:26.915 --> 01:22:28.550
<i>Erica Miller is dead.</i>


01:22:28.650 --> 01:22:30.685
<i>They say she OD'd</i>
<i>or something had drowned her</i>


01:22:30.785 --> 01:22:31.653
<i>in her bathtub.</i>


01:22:31.753 --> 01:22:33.721
<i>But I know that's not true.</i>


01:22:33.822 --> 01:22:35.956
<i>This place</i>
<i>is swarming with Feds.</i>


01:22:36.056 --> 01:22:38.125
<i>They're clearing out</i>
<i>her office.</i>


01:22:38.225 --> 01:22:40.628
<i>The Feds</i>
<i>don't investigate accidents.</i>


01:22:40.728 --> 01:22:42.429
<i>Ivy thinks Erica stole her files</i>


01:22:42.530 --> 01:22:45.867
<i>and was digging into Stonagal</i>
<i>and Dominator Analytics.</i>


01:22:45.966 --> 01:22:47.267
<i>And now, Mr. Plank--</i>


01:22:47.367 --> 01:22:49.002
<i>well, he has the whole team</i>
<i>drumming up a story</i>


01:22:49.102 --> 01:22:52.172
<i>that Dr. Burton</i>
<i>was a suicide bomber.</i>


01:22:52.272 --> 01:22:54.174
<i>Look, I'm guessing</i>
<i>this is gonna get me fired.</i>


01:22:54.274 --> 01:22:56.076
<i>But I feel like</i>
<i>I have to say something.</i>


01:22:56.176 --> 01:22:57.745
<i>Everything that's happening</i>
<i>in the world right now</i>


01:22:57.846 --> 01:22:59.012
<i>was predicted in the Bible.</i>


01:22:59.112 --> 01:23:01.348
<i>That's where you'll find</i>
<i>the answers.</i>


01:23:06.286 --> 01:23:08.288
-Hey, Ray.
-Hey.


01:23:08.388 --> 01:23:10.324
Could we talk for a minute?


01:23:10.424 --> 01:23:13.160
Yeah. Of course.


01:23:16.430 --> 01:23:17.231
So you and I,


01:23:17.331 --> 01:23:19.032
we're both married
to true believers.


01:23:19.132 --> 01:23:24.639
Can I ask you, what stopped you
from hearing it?


01:23:27.374 --> 01:23:31.613
Well, you know, I made
a lot of mistakes in my life.


01:23:31.713 --> 01:23:37.752
But blaming Irene's faith
for my own bad decisions


01:23:38.285 --> 01:23:41.021
is the biggest one
because she was right.


01:23:41.121 --> 01:23:43.791
But you couldn't have
known that then.


01:23:43.892 --> 01:23:46.460
I would have if I'd listened.


01:23:47.127 --> 01:23:50.097
It's easier to see that now.


01:23:50.197 --> 01:23:53.433
Well, you know, not for most
people, it seems.


01:23:54.669 --> 01:23:59.908
So, Irene did her job.


01:24:00.008 --> 01:24:03.277
Yeah, she did. She did.


01:24:06.079 --> 01:24:08.650
I knew it was the Rapture.


01:24:09.483 --> 01:24:13.287
But I still didn't learn
my lesson.


01:24:14.756 --> 01:24:16.123
And what lesson is that?


01:24:16.223 --> 01:24:20.093
Trying to find someone else
to blame, you know?


01:24:20.193 --> 01:24:23.196
It's never gonna lead you
to find the truth.


01:24:23.297 --> 01:24:29.136
I spent once blaming her
for not trying harder.


01:24:29.236 --> 01:24:31.873
But I know
if she had tried harder,


01:24:31.973 --> 01:24:34.141
I would have just walked out.


01:24:35.208 --> 01:24:39.681
And you're absolutely right.
Irene did do her job.


01:24:40.247 --> 01:24:44.519
And now, it's up to me
to show her


01:24:44.619 --> 01:24:47.655
that her words
weren't wasted on me.


01:24:50.024 --> 01:24:52.225
So, your turn.


01:24:52.326 --> 01:24:56.496
Same story.
Different excuses.


01:24:56.598 --> 01:25:01.368
I was just never able
to get there.


01:25:01.468 --> 01:25:03.236
Get there.


01:25:06.874 --> 01:25:08.810
To the cross.


01:25:09.376 --> 01:25:13.514
I just could never let go
of my doubt.


01:25:14.181 --> 01:25:17.952
So, what was I supposed to do?


01:25:18.052 --> 01:25:21.856
Go up there
and kneel before God


01:25:21.956 --> 01:25:23.591
and lie to him?


01:25:23.691 --> 01:25:27.595
And tell him that I believed
when I knew deep in my heart


01:25:27.695 --> 01:25:29.831
that I wasn't sure?


01:25:32.634 --> 01:25:36.771
Well, far be it for me
to lecture anybody about faith.


01:25:38.238 --> 01:25:41.075
But I do know this.


01:25:41.174 --> 01:25:43.645
Faith isn't about
having no doubt.


01:25:43.745 --> 01:25:46.748
That's not faith.
That's knowledge.


01:25:46.848 --> 01:25:52.887
Faith is about taking that walk
to the cross in spite of it.


01:25:57.224 --> 01:26:00.327
So...


01:26:00.427 --> 01:26:03.296
do you no longer
have any doubt?


01:26:03.397 --> 01:26:08.936
Well, I saw some flaws.


01:26:09.037 --> 01:26:10.772
I think that's human nature.


01:26:10.872 --> 01:26:15.777
You know, when I first got down
on my knees


01:26:15.877 --> 01:26:19.747
and asked for forgiveness,
I thought that I would,


01:26:19.847 --> 01:26:21.949
you know,
I have to meet Jesus halfway.


01:26:22.050 --> 01:26:26.353
But I was scared that--


01:26:26.453 --> 01:26:29.891
I'm scared that I couldn't even
get there halfway.


01:26:29.991 --> 01:26:33.094
I'd say I remember that we had
this picture of Jesus


01:26:33.193 --> 01:26:36.229
that we hung at home.


01:26:36.329 --> 01:26:38.432
It was up there forever.


01:26:38.533 --> 01:26:44.572
And it said, "Behold,
I stand at the door, and knock."


01:26:45.573 --> 01:26:49.376
I never knew what it meant,
but I do now.


01:26:49.476 --> 01:26:54.716
He's knocking at your door
right now.


01:26:57.284 --> 01:27:00.188
You don't have
to meet him halfway.


01:27:00.655 --> 01:27:04.892
You just have to open a door.


01:27:19.907 --> 01:27:20.273
Chloe?


01:27:27.014 --> 01:27:29.416
When you told me
to meet you here,


01:27:29.517 --> 01:27:32.019
You didn't mentioned
we'd be digging someone up.


01:27:34.689 --> 01:27:36.991
Are you sure
you want to do this?


01:27:38.760 --> 01:27:41.763
I don't want to. I need to.


01:27:41.863 --> 01:27:43.798
I understand.


01:27:43.898 --> 01:27:47.602
I just-- digging up a grave
like this is just a little--


01:27:48.136 --> 01:27:50.403
What, crazy?


01:27:50.504 --> 01:27:53.007
I was gonna say extreme.


01:27:54.909 --> 01:27:57.745
Well, I can say the same thing
about Stonagal.


01:27:57.845 --> 01:28:00.948
At least the grave I'm digging
isn't my own.


01:28:02.282 --> 01:28:04.218
Chloe, I know what you hope
to find in here.


01:28:04.317 --> 01:28:06.554
But what if it's just--


01:28:10.390 --> 01:28:12.693
Then at least I'll know.


01:28:18.298 --> 01:28:22.537
Okay. Okay.


01:28:24.038 --> 01:28:25.640
Are you ready?


01:28:36.250 --> 01:28:40.154
Chloe got what she needed
that night, proof.


01:28:40.254 --> 01:28:44.491
Not just proof of the Rapture,
but something much bigger.


01:28:44.592 --> 01:28:48.461
Proof that the Bible was right,
that God was real,


01:28:48.563 --> 01:28:50.164
that Jesus was real.


01:28:50.264 --> 01:28:51.498
It was undeniable.


01:28:51.599 --> 01:28:53.935
And she truly believed
that she had been gifted


01:28:54.035 --> 01:28:55.236
with a miracle.


01:28:55.335 --> 01:28:58.272
That Buck was there
to see it with her.


01:28:58.371 --> 01:29:00.440
Even you have to admit,


01:29:00.541 --> 01:29:02.510
this is getting pretty hard
to deny.


01:29:02.610 --> 01:29:05.680
Those who are gone,
they knew the truth.


01:29:05.780 --> 01:29:10.218
Brothers, sisters,
we can no longer hide


01:29:10.318 --> 01:29:12.086
from the truth.


01:29:12.186 --> 01:29:16.824
We must commit here and now
to accepting the truth,


01:29:16.924 --> 01:29:19.359
and accepting our role
and sharing it


01:29:19.459 --> 01:29:21.963
with as many people as we can.


01:29:22.730 --> 01:29:26.634
We have lied to ourselves
for too long.


01:29:27.034 --> 01:29:29.070
Join me.


01:29:29.170 --> 01:29:32.006
Join us.


01:29:43.985 --> 01:29:46.787
Hey, aren't you ready?


01:29:46.888 --> 01:29:49.924
Look, I can't get saved
as a favor to you.


01:29:51.458 --> 01:29:53.861
This is the only way.


01:29:54.762 --> 01:29:57.064
You should go.
I have to make a quick call.


01:29:57.164 --> 01:29:58.532
I'll be back.


01:30:05.206 --> 01:30:07.141
Let us pray.


01:30:07.642 --> 01:30:10.477
Lord, we thank You.


01:30:11.145 --> 01:30:14.682
We know that we are rebuilding
our church, Lord,


01:30:14.782 --> 01:30:18.653
and we ask for Your guidance
as we go forward.


01:30:19.954 --> 01:30:23.190
We accept You into our hearts,
Lord.


01:30:24.158 --> 01:30:28.596
And we are graciously thankful
for Your presence with us today.


01:30:34.302 --> 01:30:36.070
Hi. It's Cameron Williams.


01:30:36.170 --> 01:30:37.437
Buck, how are you my friend?


01:30:37.538 --> 01:30:40.207
Yeah. Look, I'm fine.
I don't have a lot of time.


01:30:40.308 --> 01:30:42.442
-Are you alone?
-Yes.


01:30:42.543 --> 01:30:44.612
I'm calling to warn you.


01:30:44.712 --> 01:30:47.381
I have clear evidence
that Jonathan Stonagal


01:30:47.480 --> 01:30:49.216
is not who he appears to be.


01:30:49.317 --> 01:30:50.651
<i>I'm doing some digging</i>
<i>on the guy.</i>


01:30:50.751 --> 01:30:53.354
He's been killing people
for asking too many questions.


01:30:53.453 --> 01:30:54.454
What?


01:30:54.555 --> 01:30:55.723
He's taking the entire
Eden Pay Project


01:30:55.823 --> 01:30:58.793
and piggyback all kinds of
extras into it.


01:30:58.893 --> 01:31:00.661
Spyware, for lack
of better terms.


01:31:00.761 --> 01:31:03.898
-But how?
-Trust me. He's done it.


01:31:03.998 --> 01:31:06.367
And as far
as the recent vanishings,


01:31:06.466 --> 01:31:07.868
all faked by Stonagal.


01:31:07.969 --> 01:31:10.470
I have proof that he's been
using you and Nicolae


01:31:10.571 --> 01:31:11.471
for his own ends.


01:31:11.572 --> 01:31:14.408
I don't know what to say.


01:31:14.508 --> 01:31:15.977
Look, I'm gonna come to you
now.


01:31:16.077 --> 01:31:17.244
I'll bring the evidence.


01:31:17.345 --> 01:31:21.015
But I need you to tell Nicolae
and I need you to do it now.


01:31:34.695 --> 01:31:39.000
Nicolae, I just had
a very disturbing call


01:31:39.100 --> 01:31:40.801
from Cameron Williams.


01:31:40.901 --> 01:31:43.938
He says he has proof
that Stonagal is setting us up,


01:31:44.038 --> 01:31:47.108
and that he has killed people
in the process.


01:31:47.208 --> 01:31:48.175
Do you trust him?


01:31:48.275 --> 01:31:50.611
Cameron Williams?
I have known him for years.


01:31:50.711 --> 01:31:53.247
He's always been
completely honest.


01:31:55.616 --> 01:31:58.119
Then we have to bring him in.


01:31:58.219 --> 01:32:01.155
I need to confront
both of them in person.


01:32:01.722 --> 01:32:03.224
I'll call an emergency meeting


01:32:03.324 --> 01:32:05.760
of the Security Council
tomorrow.


01:32:05.860 --> 01:32:07.261
Good.


01:32:18.839 --> 01:32:21.108
I'm sorry, I was so stubborn.


01:32:22.710 --> 01:32:25.446
I guess now we both know
how mom has to fall.


01:32:25.546 --> 01:32:26.647
Yeah.


01:32:27.715 --> 01:32:30.284
I just got off the phone
with Chaim Rosenzweig.


01:32:30.384 --> 01:32:31.419
We're going to confront
Stonagal


01:32:31.520 --> 01:32:33.187
with everything Dirk found.


01:32:33.287 --> 01:32:35.256
Hopefully, stop him
from turning the world


01:32:35.356 --> 01:32:36.557
into a dystopian nightmare.


01:32:36.657 --> 01:32:38.926
-I'll see you soon.
-Wait, Buck, wait.


01:32:39.026 --> 01:32:43.130
You really should take
a look at this first.


01:32:43.230 --> 01:32:44.765
All right, I've seen
all this stuff before.


01:32:44.865 --> 01:32:48.235
It's just heads and horns
and beasts could mean anything.


01:32:48.335 --> 01:32:49.670
No offense to the rest of you.


01:32:49.770 --> 01:32:51.972
I just don't happen to believe
our future is preordained.


01:32:52.073 --> 01:32:54.075
So, please,
let me just finish--


01:32:54.175 --> 01:32:55.476
Just let you ignore it?


01:32:55.576 --> 01:32:58.212
Because it doesn't fit
your narrative?


01:32:59.046 --> 01:33:01.449
No Chloe I--


01:33:02.483 --> 01:33:06.821
2THES2, that was the password
Dirk used to get into Eden.


01:33:14.728 --> 01:33:17.231
Okay, I'm listening.


01:33:19.500 --> 01:33:20.701
Okay. So, according to this,


01:33:20.801 --> 01:33:23.003
we should be expecting
a Jewish Temple,


01:33:23.104 --> 01:33:24.972
which would replace
the Dome of the Rock,


01:33:25.072 --> 01:33:26.740
which would pretty much
seem impossible


01:33:26.841 --> 01:33:29.910
if it wasn't
for this peace treaty


01:33:30.010 --> 01:33:32.079
that gives Israel
the UN's protection.


01:33:32.179 --> 01:33:34.549
And such a treaty
would also seem highly unlikely


01:33:34.648 --> 01:33:38.119
if it wasn't for this guy.


01:33:38.219 --> 01:33:39.588
Right.


01:33:40.221 --> 01:33:42.056
So, you actually think
Jonathan Stonagal


01:33:42.156 --> 01:33:43.157
is the Antichrist?


01:33:43.257 --> 01:33:46.227
Well, if I had to guess right
now, I'd say yes.


01:33:46.327 --> 01:33:48.295
Or what if that's what
he wants you to guess?


01:33:48.395 --> 01:33:50.164
But why?


01:33:50.264 --> 01:33:51.665
What if he's trying to get
the entire world


01:33:51.765 --> 01:33:53.400
to think he's here to save it?


01:33:53.501 --> 01:33:54.735
I mean, you're the one who said


01:33:54.835 --> 01:33:56.036
everyone is gonna worship
this guy.


01:33:56.137 --> 01:33:58.305
Well, what about
Nicolae Carpathia?


01:33:58.405 --> 01:33:59.340
I mean, certainly,


01:33:59.440 --> 01:34:00.808
he gets good crowds
behind him.


01:34:00.908 --> 01:34:02.810
No, Nicolae could care less
about having people love him.


01:34:02.910 --> 01:34:04.044
So, why would he pretend
to be the--


01:34:04.145 --> 01:34:06.313
Buck, we're not talking
about anyone


01:34:06.413 --> 01:34:08.082
pretending to be the Antichrist.


01:34:08.182 --> 01:34:12.086
We're talking about someone
being the Antichrist.


01:34:12.186 --> 01:34:13.721
Now, I can't make you
believe anything.


01:34:13.821 --> 01:34:14.989
No one can.


01:34:15.089 --> 01:34:16.891
But don't turn this
into a conspiracy


01:34:16.991 --> 01:34:18.092
just because you want
to avoid the truth.


01:34:18.192 --> 01:34:20.728
Okay. Okay, I have seen
what's inside


01:34:20.828 --> 01:34:22.564
the Eden Pay Project.


01:34:22.663 --> 01:34:24.965
And believe me,
it's not a pretty picture.


01:34:25.065 --> 01:34:26.100
If this guy gets in control


01:34:26.200 --> 01:34:28.235
of the entire world's
money supply.


01:34:28.335 --> 01:34:29.837
I mean, think about
what that would mean.


01:34:29.937 --> 01:34:32.673
Well, I can tell you exactly
what that's going to mean.


01:34:35.776 --> 01:34:38.012
He causes all
both small and great,


01:34:38.112 --> 01:34:41.616
rich and poor, free and slave
to receive a mark


01:34:41.715 --> 01:34:44.553
on their right hand
or in their foreheads.


01:34:44.653 --> 01:34:49.790
And that no one may buy or sell
except one who has the mark.


01:34:54.596 --> 01:34:56.830
Chaim just talked to Nicolae.


01:34:56.931 --> 01:34:58.766
We're going to meet first thing
in the morning.


01:34:58.866 --> 01:35:02.069
I have a lot of work to do.
I got to go. Bye.


01:35:04.305 --> 01:35:06.240
Pray for me.


01:35:06.340 --> 01:35:09.476
That boy is gonna need
a whole lot more than prayer.


01:35:13.582 --> 01:35:15.282
Buck!


01:35:15.716 --> 01:35:17.652
Are you even listening
to a word they said?


01:35:17.751 --> 01:35:18.719
You can't go there.


01:35:18.819 --> 01:35:19.853
I heard the same thing you did.


01:35:19.954 --> 01:35:22.756
Well, it doesn't look
that way to me.


01:35:22.856 --> 01:35:25.459
Chloe, you found
what you're looking for.


01:35:25.560 --> 01:35:28.630
And I'm so happy that you did.
But that was your answer.


01:35:28.762 --> 01:35:30.731
Not mine. I'm still looking.


01:35:30.831 --> 01:35:34.802
That wasn't my answer.
That was the answer.


01:35:35.869 --> 01:35:38.806
-I understand.
-No, I don't think you do.


01:35:39.541 --> 01:35:42.209
I know. I have to go.


01:35:42.309 --> 01:35:43.744
I'll be very careful.
I promise.


01:35:43.844 --> 01:35:45.879
Okay. Just...


01:35:48.650 --> 01:35:50.384
at least take this.


01:35:59.393 --> 01:36:01.428
I love you, Chloe Steele.


01:36:01.529 --> 01:36:03.264
I love you, too.


01:36:22.049 --> 01:36:24.084
I'm sorry to drop all this
on you at the last minute.


01:36:24.184 --> 01:36:25.152
I just--


01:36:25.252 --> 01:36:27.921
These are high stakes, Buck.
I understand that.


01:36:28.022 --> 01:36:29.990
And so does Nicolae.


01:36:30.090 --> 01:36:32.126
We have to do it properly.
And we will.


01:36:32.226 --> 01:36:34.795
God is with Israel, remember?


01:36:35.262 --> 01:36:37.231
Yeah. I just hope the peace
accord with Israel


01:36:37.331 --> 01:36:39.099
can still happen
without Stonagal.


01:36:39.199 --> 01:36:42.970
If God wants it to happen now,
it will happen now.


01:36:43.070 --> 01:36:46.840
But this is not just about
the peace treaty.


01:36:46.940 --> 01:36:50.512
I have long dreamed
of finally having the Temple


01:36:50.612 --> 01:36:52.880
rebuilt on the Temple Mount.


01:36:52.980 --> 01:36:54.716
And when Stonagal agreed
to finance it,


01:36:54.815 --> 01:36:57.951
it was the happiest day
of my life.


01:36:58.952 --> 01:37:01.155
Well, what about
the Dome of the Rock?


01:37:01.255 --> 01:37:03.257
Are the Arabs really just gonna
let you tear it down?


01:37:03.357 --> 01:37:05.092
No. Of course not.


01:37:05.192 --> 01:37:06.994
Stonagal's team located
the foundations


01:37:07.094 --> 01:37:09.296
of the original temple.


01:37:09.396 --> 01:37:13.500
It's beside the dome,
not under it.


01:37:13.601 --> 01:37:15.102
-So, we can have both.
-Yes.


01:37:15.202 --> 01:37:17.037
And peace in the Middle East.


01:37:17.137 --> 01:37:20.874
Arabs and Jews worshiping
side by side in harmony.


01:37:20.974 --> 01:37:22.644
And even though
the initial peace treaty


01:37:22.744 --> 01:37:28.115
will only be seven years,
I think-- what's wrong, Buck?


01:37:28.215 --> 01:37:31.385
-Did you just say seven years?
-Yes.


01:37:35.189 --> 01:37:37.525
I just need a minute.


01:37:55.309 --> 01:37:59.413
It's all real. It's all real.


01:38:13.193 --> 01:38:16.296
I didn't want to believe
in you, God.


01:38:17.064 --> 01:38:21.368
But I was wrong,
and I'm so sorry.


01:38:27.174 --> 01:38:29.943
Please forgive me, Jesus.


01:38:33.914 --> 01:38:37.384
I just know that I need you.


01:38:37.985 --> 01:38:40.220
And I do believe...


01:38:46.861 --> 01:38:49.930
I love you, dear Jesus.


01:38:56.036 --> 01:38:58.573
Show me what to do.


01:38:59.574 --> 01:39:01.509
Jesus promised
that where two or three


01:39:01.609 --> 01:39:04.879
gather in my name,
there I am with them.


01:39:04.978 --> 01:39:06.947
We gathered and we prayed.


01:39:07.047 --> 01:39:10.017
And I felt his presence
for the very first time.


01:39:12.520 --> 01:39:14.889
<i>Hey, Connor, it's me, Buck.</i>


01:39:14.988 --> 01:39:16.190
<i>I got your message.</i>


01:39:16.290 --> 01:39:19.894
<i>I just wanted to let you know</i>
<i>you were right.</i>


01:39:19.993 --> 01:39:21.830
<i>I found the truth</i>
<i>in the only place</i>


01:39:21.930 --> 01:39:23.464
<i>- it can be found.</i>
- Thank you, Jesus.


01:39:23.565 --> 01:39:25.834
<i>I'm gonna need your help</i>
<i>with something.</i>


01:39:34.107 --> 01:39:35.910
- Connor.
- Good, you have my message.


01:39:36.009 --> 01:39:39.079
Buck still had his focus
clearly on his journalistic duty


01:39:39.179 --> 01:39:41.381
to expose Stonagal's lies.


01:39:41.482 --> 01:39:44.184
But he also knew
there was a very real chance


01:39:44.284 --> 01:39:47.254
that no matter what evidence
he brought to the table,


01:39:47.354 --> 01:39:49.891
old Steve Plank
would never let that news


01:39:49.990 --> 01:39:51.826
see the light of day.


01:39:51.926 --> 01:39:55.462
Connor was Buck's insurance
policy against being censored.


01:39:55.563 --> 01:39:58.031
And he hoped their faith
would be enough to keep them


01:39:58.131 --> 01:40:00.200
from being deceived
by Stonagal,


01:40:00.300 --> 01:40:03.538
even if he was working
for the devil himself.


01:40:04.404 --> 01:40:07.341
-Hi. I'm--
-Mr. Cameron Williams.


01:40:07.441 --> 01:40:08.610
Good morning.


01:40:08.710 --> 01:40:10.077
Please see a member
of the security team


01:40:10.177 --> 01:40:11.211
on your way in.


01:40:11.311 --> 01:40:13.080
-They'll show you the way.
-Thank you.


01:40:14.849 --> 01:40:18.586
Ephesians Chapter 6 tells us
to put on the full armor of God


01:40:18.686 --> 01:40:22.122
so that you can take your stand
against the devil schemes.


01:40:22.222 --> 01:40:23.758
Well, Buck may not have
known it.


01:40:23.858 --> 01:40:27.762
But when he walked into the room
that day, he was ready.


01:40:27.862 --> 01:40:30.665
Ready like he had never
been before.


01:40:30.765 --> 01:40:33.902
He hit them with everything
he and Dirk had uncovered,


01:40:34.002 --> 01:40:35.937
exposing beyond the shadow
of a doubt


01:40:36.036 --> 01:40:39.306
Stonagal's evil plan
to deceive the world.


01:40:39.406 --> 01:40:43.343
As soon as he was finished,
he felt a huge flood of relief.


01:40:43.443 --> 01:40:45.547
He had managed to get the truth
to the people


01:40:45.647 --> 01:40:46.814
who needed to hear it.


01:40:46.915 --> 01:40:47.782
To enslave...


01:40:47.882 --> 01:40:49.082
Or so it seemed.


01:40:49.182 --> 01:40:53.253
So as you can clearly see
this diabolical plan,


01:40:53.353 --> 01:40:54.789
not only take over
the money supply,


01:40:54.889 --> 01:40:58.693
but to enslave the world
in a technocratic nightmare.


01:40:59.459 --> 01:41:01.128
It was all set up
at the highest levels.


01:41:01.228 --> 01:41:03.998
- What is he talking about?
- Thank you.


01:41:08.603 --> 01:41:12.139
Thankfully,
Mr. Williams' investigation


01:41:12.239 --> 01:41:15.275
has put the pieces together
showing all of us


01:41:15.375 --> 01:41:19.514
that Jonathan has plotted, lied,
and murdered,


01:41:19.614 --> 01:41:23.216
not only to gain control
of Eden currency,


01:41:23.317 --> 01:41:26.621
but the entire global
financial network.


01:41:28.488 --> 01:41:31.593
That's ridiculous.
What's going on here?


01:41:33.093 --> 01:41:35.362
That is the question.


01:41:35.462 --> 01:41:39.132
The question each of us
has been asking.


01:41:40.768 --> 01:41:43.705
What is really going on?


01:41:44.706 --> 01:41:49.242
Mr. Williams, for example,
he has employed his skills


01:41:49.343 --> 01:41:53.246
to draw certain conclusions
about you.


01:41:53.347 --> 01:41:58.185
But in fact, if he thinks
about it hard enough,


01:41:58.285 --> 01:42:02.090
he'll have to ask himself
who was on the inside


01:42:02.189 --> 01:42:05.660
that gave him access
to what exactly.


01:42:08.997 --> 01:42:12.265
A highly convenient file
full of evidence


01:42:12.366 --> 01:42:16.070
implicating Jonathan
of all he's been accused of


01:42:16.169 --> 01:42:18.138
here today.


01:42:19.373 --> 01:42:22.442
I half expected you to see
right through that.


01:42:23.410 --> 01:42:27.615
And, Chaim, your fervent dream
to bring peace to Israel


01:42:27.715 --> 01:42:32.720
has been granted,
if only you understood the cost.


01:42:35.690 --> 01:42:40.028
And, Jonathan,
this goes much deeper for you,


01:42:40.128 --> 01:42:41.294
doesn't it?


01:42:41.395 --> 01:42:43.531
Beyond your endless thirst


01:42:43.631 --> 01:42:46.333
for more control
and material gain,


01:42:46.433 --> 01:42:49.169
you really see yourself
as a great man


01:42:49.269 --> 01:42:53.206
rebuilding the world
in your own image.


01:42:53.306 --> 01:42:56.376
You certainly needed no help
for me to see that.


01:42:57.745 --> 01:43:00.414
You have paved the way.


01:43:00.515 --> 01:43:04.418
That is your contribution
to history.


01:43:04.519 --> 01:43:08.589
This is preposterous.


01:43:08.690 --> 01:43:11.526
You can't just come in here
make these baseless allegations.


01:43:11.626 --> 01:43:15.096
And think you can take
what I built, what is mine?


01:43:15.195 --> 01:43:17.264
How do you think
you're gonna do that, Nicolae?


01:43:18.198 --> 01:43:20.333
Let me tell you
what is about to happen.


01:43:20.434 --> 01:43:23.503
An assassin masquerading
as a security guard


01:43:23.604 --> 01:43:28.710
Will draw his gun
intent on killing Mr. Stonagal


01:43:28.810 --> 01:43:29.777
and myself.


01:43:29.877 --> 01:43:33.848
And a hail of gunfire,
Mr. Cothran and Stonagal


01:43:33.948 --> 01:43:36.117
will be fatally wounded.


01:43:36.216 --> 01:43:38.820
I'll barely escape with my life.


01:43:38.920 --> 01:43:42.322
Thanks to security guards
who quickly returned fire.


01:43:45.425 --> 01:43:47.427
You're insane.


01:43:47.528 --> 01:43:51.099
What makes you think
you can get away with this?


01:43:51.199 --> 01:43:55.203
By... simply killing you.


01:43:57.370 --> 01:44:02.977
You see, Jonathan,
there will be peace.


01:44:03.077 --> 01:44:05.012
But not with you.


01:44:06.581 --> 01:44:09.282
Nicolae.


01:44:09.382 --> 01:44:11.284
Your time is over.


01:44:11.384 --> 01:44:14.589
But mine has just begun.


01:44:35.977 --> 01:44:42.016
And now, now I am devastated
by the loss.


01:44:42.884 --> 01:44:46.187
Yet, forced...


01:44:46.286 --> 01:44:50.323
to take up the mantle
of his leadership.


01:44:51.859 --> 01:44:53.728
My God!


01:44:56.130 --> 01:44:57.330
We need to get some help.


01:45:15.183 --> 01:45:16.316
Chaim, are you okay?


01:45:16.416 --> 01:45:17.484
It was awful.


01:45:17.585 --> 01:45:20.487
One of the security guards
started firing.


01:45:21.556 --> 01:45:23.356
Hey, did you see what happened?


01:45:23.456 --> 01:45:26.060
Yes. Poor Nicolae.
I mean, who want to kill him?


01:45:40.641 --> 01:45:44.712
Mr. Williams, this is crazy.
Did you see it?


01:45:44.812 --> 01:45:46.280
I think I know
what really happened.


01:45:46.379 --> 01:45:47.480
Come with me.


01:45:51.652 --> 01:45:53.521
Buck, are you okay?


01:45:55.022 --> 01:45:57.390
Hey, what's going on?


01:46:01.863 --> 01:46:03.931
Yeah, yeah, okay.


01:46:34.028 --> 01:46:34.862
Yes.


01:46:56.017 --> 01:46:59.921
Ladies and gentlemen,
my name is Nicolae Carpathia.


01:47:00.021 --> 01:47:01.789
And I come to you tonight
with a heavy heart.


01:47:01.889 --> 01:47:05.293
<i>- Good afternoon.</i>
<i>- My name is Cameron Williams.</i>


01:47:05.393 --> 01:47:07.762
<i>I'm here to tell you a story.</i>


01:47:07.862 --> 01:47:12.934
Story about lies
from the media, murder,


01:47:13.034 --> 01:47:16.503
<i>story about the only truth</i>
<i>that matters.</i>


01:47:19.073 --> 01:47:22.043
<i>Nicolae Carpathia</i>
<i>is the new Secretary General</i>


01:47:22.143 --> 01:47:22.810
<i>of the UN.</i>


01:47:22.910 --> 01:47:25.579
<i>Right now, he's making a speech.</i>


01:47:25.680 --> 01:47:29.583
<i>Well, I'm here to tell you.</i>
<i>It's all lies.</i>


01:47:29.684 --> 01:47:32.853
<i>Looks like Cameron Williams</i>
<i>finally found the truth.</i>


01:47:32.954 --> 01:47:33.854
Yes.


01:47:34.487 --> 01:47:36.456
He's gotta be on this floor.


01:47:38.392 --> 01:47:41.629
<i>He told you that the vanishings</i>
<i>came with no warning,</i>


01:47:41.729 --> 01:47:44.031
<i>with no explanation.</i>


01:47:44.131 --> 01:47:47.668
<i>That there was a second wave</i>
<i>of vanishing.</i>


01:47:47.768 --> 01:47:50.538
<i>And worst of all, he told you</i>


01:47:50.638 --> 01:47:53.140
<i>that the Rapture</i>
<i>had been debunked.</i>


01:47:53.240 --> 01:47:55.242
<i>Take a picture of your screen</i>
<i>right now--</i>


01:47:55.343 --> 01:47:56.644
<i>Turn it off!</i>


01:47:56.744 --> 01:47:58.212
<i>And no matter what you may hear,</i>


01:47:58.312 --> 01:48:02.016
<i>it's not too late to let</i>
<i>Jesus Christ set you free.</i>


01:48:02.116 --> 01:48:03.351
<i>I'm proof of that.</i>


01:48:03.451 --> 01:48:05.386
When Buck's broadcast
went out to the world,


01:48:05.485 --> 01:48:07.421
it felt like a huge victory.


01:48:07.521 --> 01:48:09.523
But the Bible warned us
it wouldn't be as easy


01:48:09.623 --> 01:48:12.059
as just telling everyone
the truth.


01:48:12.159 --> 01:48:14.762
But I've always thought,
and now I believe


01:48:14.862 --> 01:48:17.131
that even if a single soul
is saved,


01:48:17.231 --> 01:48:19.667
then your efforts
have not been in vain.


01:48:19.767 --> 01:48:22.236
Right now though,
the impact of Buck's message


01:48:22.336 --> 01:48:23.804
would have to be analyzed later.


01:48:23.904 --> 01:48:26.007
He knew some people were bound
to disagree


01:48:26.107 --> 01:48:27.875
with what he had to say.


01:48:48.863 --> 01:48:50.931
Get those there. Thanks.


01:49:31.906 --> 01:49:33.808
Buck! Buck! Run!


01:49:37.445 --> 01:49:39.313
- Are you guys okay?
- Yeah.


01:50:06.373 --> 01:50:07.542
We made it just in time.


01:50:07.641 --> 01:50:09.210
You've got to stop
doing this to me.


01:50:11.612 --> 01:50:13.914
- Everyone okay?
- Yeah.


01:50:14.014 --> 01:50:15.015
All good.


01:50:15.116 --> 01:50:17.084
They were all so anxious
and even excited


01:50:17.184 --> 01:50:19.521
to start sharing the word
with the world.


01:50:19.620 --> 01:50:21.188
It was wonderful to see.


01:50:21.288 --> 01:50:23.224
But they'd only been
studying prophecy


01:50:23.324 --> 01:50:24.692
for a few days.


01:50:24.792 --> 01:50:26.694
The reality
of the final seven years


01:50:26.794 --> 01:50:29.463
before the return of Christ
hadn't started sinking in


01:50:29.564 --> 01:50:31.232
just yet.


01:50:31.332 --> 01:50:34.635
Jesus told us these last years
would be worse than anything


01:50:34.735 --> 01:50:36.437
the world had ever seen.


01:50:36.538 --> 01:50:38.339
Right, here's a good spot,
all right?


01:50:38.439 --> 01:50:41.041
God gave us an exemption
if we wanted it.


01:50:41.142 --> 01:50:44.478
But for those of us
who chose not to take it,


01:50:44.579 --> 01:50:47.014
those of us
who were left behind,


01:50:47.114 --> 01:50:50.151
well, we'll just have to see
what happens.


01:50:52.953 --> 01:50:54.655
I know there's nothing
we can do


01:50:54.755 --> 01:50:57.191
to stop what's been prophesied
from happening.


01:50:57.291 --> 01:50:59.760
But that doesn't mean
we just give up.


01:50:59.860 --> 01:51:02.363
Not even close.


01:51:02.463 --> 01:51:04.231
There are souls to be saved.


01:51:04.331 --> 01:51:09.436
And as long as there are,
our mission is clear.


01:51:10.938 --> 01:51:12.339
Look what it says.


01:51:14.008 --> 01:51:17.845
- Are you reading this?
- That's incredible.


01:51:17.945 --> 01:51:19.446
My goodness.

